msgid "Explicitly correlated methods"
msgstr "显式相关方法"

msgid ""
"Explicitly correlated calculations provide a dramatic improvement of the "
"basis set convergence of MP2, CCSD, CASPT2, and MRCI correlation energies. "
"Such calculations can be performed using the commands of the form"
msgstr "显式相关计算能显著改善 MP2、CCSD、CASPT2 和 MRCI 相关能的基组收敛性。此类计算可使用以下形式的命令执行："

msgid "*command*, *options*"
msgstr "*command*, *options*"

msgid "where *command* can be one of the following:"
msgstr "其中 *command* 可以是以下之一："

msgid ""
"**MP2-F12** Closed-shell canonical MP2-F12. By default, the fixed amplitude "
"ansatz (``FIX``, see below) is used, but other ansätze are also possible. "
"The F12-corrections is computed using density fitting, and then added to the"
" MP2 correlation energy obtained without density fitting."
msgstr ""
"**MP2-F12** 闭壳层正则 MP2-F12。默认使用固定振幅拟设（\\ ``FIX``\\ ，见下文），但也可使用其他拟设。F12 "
"校正通过密度拟合计算，然后加到未使用密度拟合获得的 MP2 相关能上。"

msgid ""
"**DF-MP2-F12** As MP2-F12, but the DF-MP2 correlation energy is used. This "
"is less expensive than MP2-F12."
msgstr "**DF-MP2-F12** 与 MP2-F12 类似，但使用 DF-MP2 相关能。这比 MP2-F12 计算成本更低。"

msgid ""
"**DF-RMP2-F12** Spin-restricted open-shell DF-RMP2-F12 using ansatz 3C. Any "
"method as described in `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.2889388>`__ **128**, 154103 (2008) can be used"
" (cf. sections `wave function Ansätze "
"<explicitly_correlated_methods.html#wave-function-ans-tze>`__,\\ `choosing "
"the ansatz and the level of approximation "
"<explicitly_correlated_methods.html#choosing-the-ansatz-and-the-level-of-"
"approximation>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**DF-RMP2-F12** 使用拟设 3C 的自旋限制开壳层 DF-RMP2-F12。可使用 `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.2889388>`__ **128**, 154103 (2008) "
"中描述的任何方法（参见章节 `wave function Ansätze "
"<explicitly_correlated_methods.html#wave-function-ans-tze>`__\\ 、\\ "
"`choosing the ansatz and the level of approximation "
"<explicitly_correlated_methods.html#choosing-the-ansatz-and-the-level-of-"
"approximation>`__\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"**CCSD-F12** Closed-shell CCSD-F12 approximations as described in `J. Chem. "
"Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.2817618>`__ **127**, 221106 (2007). By "
"default, the fixed amplitude ansatz is used and the CCSD-F12A and CCSD-F12B "
"energies are computed. Optionally, the command can be appended by A or B, "
"and then only the corresponding energy is computed. For more details see "
"section `CCSD(T)-F12 <explicitly_correlated_methods.html#ccsd-t-f12>`__."
msgstr ""
"**CCSD-F12** 闭壳层 CCSD-F12 近似，如 `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.2817618>`__ **127**, 221106 (2007) "
"所述。默认使用固定振幅拟设，并计算 CCSD-F12A 和 CCSD-F12B 能量。可选地，命令后可附加 A 或 "
"B，则仅计算相应的能量。更多细节请参见 `CCSD(T)-F12 <explicitly_correlated_methods.html#ccsd-"
"t-f12>`__ 一节。"

msgid ""
"**CCSD-F12c** Closed-shell CCSD(F12\\*) approximation as proposed by Hättig,"
" Tew and Köhn. In Molpro this is denoted f12c. As compared to CCSD-F12a/b it"
" requires additional computational effort. Since in some parts the "
"implementation is brute-force without paging algorithms, large memory may be"
" required. In most cases there is no gain in accuracy as compared to f12b "
"and therefore the use of this method is normally not recommended. Currently "
"CCSD-F12c is not available for open-shell cases."
msgstr ""
"**CCSD-F12c** 由 Hättig、Tew 和 Köhn 提出的闭壳层 CCSD(F12\\*) 近似。在 Molpro 中，这被表示为 "
"f12c。与 CCSD-F12a/b 相比，它需要额外的计算量。由于在某些部分的实现是蛮力式的，没有分页算法，可能需要大量内存。在大多数情况下，与 "
"f12b 相比，精度没有提升，因此通常不推荐使用此方法。目前 CCSD-F12c 不适用于开壳层情况。"

msgid "**CCSD(T)-F12** Same as CCSD-F12, but perturbative triples are added."
msgstr "**CCSD(T)-F12** 与 CCSD-F12 相同，但添加了微扰三重激发。"

msgid ""
"**CCSD(T)-F12c** Same as CCSD-F12c, but perturbative triples are added."
msgstr "**CCSD(T)-F12c** 与 CCSD-F12c 相同，但添加了微扰三重激发。"

msgid ""
"**UCCSD-F12** Open-shell unrestricted UCCSD-F12 approximations as described "
"by G. Knizia, T. B. Adler, and H.-J. Werner, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3054300>`__ **130**, 054104 (2009). Restricted"
" open-shell Hartree-Fock (RHF) orbitals are used. Optionally, the command "
"can be appended by A or B, and then only the corresponding energy is "
"computed. For more details see section `CCSD(T)-F12 "
"<explicitly_correlated_methods.html#ccsd-t-f12>`__."
msgstr ""
"**UCCSD-F12** 开壳层非限制性 UCCSD-F12 近似，如 G. Knizia、T. B. Adler 和 H.-J. Werner 在 "
"`J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3054300>`__ **130**, 054104 "
"(2009) 中所述。使用限制性开壳层 Hartree-Fock (RHF) 轨道。可选地，命令后可附加 A 或 B，则仅计算相应的能量。更多细节请参见"
" `CCSD(T)-F12 <explicitly_correlated_methods.html#ccsd-t-f12>`__ 一节。"

msgid ""
"**UCCSD(T)-F12** Same as UCCSD-F12, but perturbative triples are added."
msgstr "**UCCSD(T)-F12** 与 UCCSD-F12 相同，但添加了微扰三重激发。"

msgid ""
"**RCCSD(T)-F12** Similar to UCCSD(T)-F12, but the partially spin-adapted "
"scheme is used."
msgstr "**RCCSD(T)-F12** 与 UCCSD(T)-F12 类似，但使用了部分自旋适应的方案。"

msgid ""
"**DCSD-F12** Closed-shell CCSD-F12 approximations applied to DCSD method, "
"see CCSD-F12 for more details."
msgstr "**DCSD-F12** 应用于 DCSD 方法的闭壳层 CCSD-F12 近似，更多细节请参见 CCSD-F12。"

msgid ""
"**UDCSD-F12** Open-shell unrestricted CCSD-F12 approximations applied to "
"DCSD method, see UCCSD-F12 for more details."
msgstr "**UDCSD-F12** 应用于 DCSD 方法的开壳层非限制性 CCSD-F12 近似，详情请参阅 UCCSD-F12。"

msgid ""
"**RDCSD-F12** Open-shell partially spin-adapted CCSD-F12 approximations "
"applied to DCSD method."
msgstr "**RDCSD-F12** 应用于 DCSD 方法的开壳层部分自旋适应 CCSD-F12 近似。"

msgid ""
"**RS2-F12** CASPT2-F12 method as described in `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3489000>`__ **133**, 141103 (2010)."
msgstr ""
"**RS2-F12** CASPT2-F12 方法，如 `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3489000>`__ **133**, 141103 (2010) 中所述。"

msgid ""
"**MRCI-F12** MRCI-F12 method as described in `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3528720>`__ **134**, 034113 (2011), `J. Chem. "
"Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3587632>`__ **134**, 184104 (2011), and "
"`Mol. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1080/00268976.2013.779393>`__ **111**, "
"607 (2013)."
msgstr ""
"**MRCI-F12** MRCI-F12 方法，如 `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3528720>`__ **134**, 034113 (2011)、\\ `J. "
"Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3587632>`__ **134**, 184104 (2011)"
" 和 `Mol. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1080/00268976.2013.779393>`__ **111**,"
" 607 (2013) 中所述。"

msgid ""
"For computing first-order properties and geometry optimization see section "
"`analytical gradients for MP2-F12 and CCSD(T)-F12 "
"<explicitly_correlated_methods.html#analytical-gradients-for-mp2-f12-and-"
"ccsd-t-f12>`__."
msgstr ""
"关于计算一阶性质和几何优化，请参见章节 `analytical gradients for MP2-F12 and CCSD(T)-F12 "
"<explicitly_correlated_methods.html#analytical-gradients-for-mp2-f12-and-"
"ccsd-t-f12>`__\\ 。"

msgid "Reference functions"
msgstr "参考函数"

msgid ""
"The MP2-F12, CCSD-F12, and UCCSD-F12 methods must use conventional (non-"
"density fitted) spin-restricted Hartree-Fock reference functions (HF or "
"RHF). DF-HF cannot be used for these methods. This restriction is necessary "
"to ensure that the Fock matrix is diagonal and consistent with the integrals"
" used in these methods. For DF-MP2-F12, DF-LMP2-F12, and DF-RMP2-F12 either "
"HF or DF-HF reference functions can be used."
msgstr ""
"MP2-F12、CCSD-F12 和 UCCSD-F12 方法必须使用传统的（非密度拟合）自旋限制 Hartree-Fock 参考函数（HF 或 "
"RHF）。这些方法不能使用 DF-HF。此限制对于确保 Fock 矩阵是对角矩阵，并与这些方法中使用的积分保持一致是必要的。对于 DF-"
"MP2-F12、DF-LMP2-F12 和 DF-RMP2-F12，可以使用 HF 或 DF-HF 参考函数。"

msgid ""
"Currently, only finite dipole fields can be applied, other perturbations are"
" not yet supported. ECPs can be used, but this is still experimental and not"
" extensively benchmarked. The Douglas-Kroll-Hess or eXact-2-Component "
"Hamiltonians cannot currently be used in combination with F12 methods."
msgstr ""
"目前，只能施加有限偶极场，其他微扰尚不支持。可以使用 ECP，但这仍处于实验阶段，且未经过广泛基准测试。目前无法将 Douglas-Kroll-Hess"
" 或 eXact-2-Component 哈密顿量与 F12 方法结合使用。"

msgid "Wave function Ansätze"
msgstr "波函数拟设"

msgid ""
"The so called ”ansatz” determines the definition of the explicitly "
"correlated wave function. This is to be distinguished from the various "
"approximations that can be used to approximate the Hamiltonian matrix "
"elements. Generally, we use ansatz **3** (cf. **I**), for which the "
"projector has the form"
msgstr ""
"所谓的“拟设”决定了显式相关波函数的定义。这应与用于近似哈密顿矩阵元的各种近似方法区分开来。通常，我们使用拟设 **3**\\ （参见 **I**\\ "
"），其投影算符具有以下形式"

msgid ""
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"  \\hat Q_{12} &=& (1-\\hat o_1) (1 - \\hat o_2) (1 - \\hat v_1 \\hat v_2),\\nonumber\\end{aligned}"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"  \\hat Q_{12} &=& (1-\\hat o_1) (1 - \\hat o_2) (1 - \\hat v_1 \\hat v_2),\\nonumber\\end{aligned}"

msgid ""
"where :math:`\\hat o_i` is a one-electron projector for electron :math:`i` "
"onto the occupied space, and :math:`\\hat v_i` projects onto the virtual "
"orbital space. In the case that domain approximations are used in local "
"explicitly correlated wave functions, the operators :math:`\\hat v` are "
"replaced by operators :math:`\\hat d^{ij}` that project just onto the domain"
" for the orbital pair :math:`ij`."
msgstr ""
"\\ 其中 :math:`\\hat o_i` 是电子 :math:`i` 到占据空间的一电子投影算符，而 :math:`\\hat v_i` "
"投影到虚轨道空间。在局部显式相关波函数中使用域近似的情况下，算符 :math:`\\hat v` 被替换为仅投影到轨道对 :math:`ij` "
"的域上的算符 :math:`\\hat d^{ij}`\\ 。"

msgid "In MOLPRO the following wave function ansätze can be used:"
msgstr "在 MOLPRO 中，可以使用以下波函数拟设："

msgid "The general ansatz"
msgstr "一般拟设"

msgid "The diagonal ansatz (D)"
msgstr "对角拟设 (D)"

msgid "The fixed amplitude ansatz (FIX)"
msgstr "固定振幅拟设 (FIX)"

msgid ""
"The diagonal ansatz is used and the amplitudes of the explicitly correlated "
"configurations are determined by the wavefunction cusp conditions, i.e."
msgstr "使用对角拟设，并且显式相关组态的振幅由波函数尖点条件确定，即"

msgid ""
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
" T^{ij,1}_{ij} &=& \\frac{1}{2} \\nonumber\\\\\n"
" T^{ij,-1}_{ij} &=& \\frac{1}{4}\\nonumber\\end{aligned}"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
" T^{ij,1}_{ij} &=& \\frac{1}{2} \\nonumber\\\\\n"
" T^{ij,-1}_{ij} &=& \\frac{1}{4}\\nonumber\\end{aligned}"

msgid "This ansatz is orbital invariant, size consistent and free of GBSSE."
msgstr "\\ 此拟设具有轨道不变性、大小一致性，并且没有 GBSSE。"

msgid "RI Approximations"
msgstr "RI 近似"

msgid ""
"If the extended Brillouin condition (EBC, see **I**) is assumed, the "
"explicitly correlated and conventional amplitude equations decouple and can "
"be solved independently. These approximations are denoted by a star, e.g. "
"**3**\\*C."
msgstr ""
"如果假设扩展布里渊条件（EBC，参见 **I**\\ ），则显式相关和常规的振幅方程解耦，可以独立求解。这些近似用星号表示，例如 **3**\\ "
"\\*C。"

msgid "Basis sets"
msgstr "基组"

msgid ""
"In MOLPRO the F12 integrals can only be computed using density fitting (DF) "
"approximations. The many electron integrals are approximated by resolutions "
"of the identity (RI) expansions. Thus, F12 calculations require three "
"different basis sets: the orbital (AO) basis, the DF basis, and the RI "
"basis."
msgstr ""
"在 MOLPRO 中，F12 积分只能使用密度拟合（DF）近似来计算。多电子积分通过分辨率恒等（RI）展开来近似。因此，F12 "
"计算需要三种不同的基组：轨道（AO）基组、DF 基组和 RI 基组。"

msgid ""
"We recommend as AO basis sets the augmented correlation consistent basis "
"sets (denoted AVnZ) or the specially optimized correlation consistent F12 "
"basis sets (denoted VnZ-F12, cf. K.A. Peterson and H.-J. Werner, `J. Chem. "
"Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.2831537>`__ **128**, 084102 (2008)). "
"Normally, triples zeta basis sets (AVTZ or VTZ-F12) yield excellent results "
"that are close to the basis set limit. Diffuse basis functions are rather "
"essential both for the HF and MP2-F12 energies, and therefore the standard "
"VTZ sets are not recommended. If the AVnZ, [A]VnZ-F12, or VnZ-PP-F12 orbital"
" basis sets are used, suitable density fitting (DF) basis and resolution of "
"the identity (RI) basis sets are automatically chosen. For the AVnZ orbital "
"basis sets, AVnZ/MP2FIT and VnZ/JKFIT basis sets are used by default for the"
" DF and RI, respectively. The associated optimized CABS basis set of "
"Peterson et al. can be chosen by specifying ``RI_BASIS=OPTRI``. For the "
"[a]VnZ-F12 and [a][c]VnZ-PP-F12 orbital basis, the associated CABS (OPTRI) "
"basis sets are used by default. However, OPTRI sets are not yet available "
"for all elements, and in such cases an alternative RI basis must be "
"explicitly specified using the ``RI_BASIS`` option."
msgstr ""
"我们推荐使用增强的相关一致基组（表示为 AVnZ）或专门优化的相关一致 F12 基组（表示为 VnZ-F12，参见 K.A. Peterson 和 "
"H.-J. Werner, `J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.2831537>`__ "
"**128**, 084102 (2008)）作为原子轨道基组。通常，三重 zeta 基组（AVTZ 或 "
"VTZ-F12）能产生接近基组极限的优异结果。弥散基函数对于 HF 和 MP2-F12 能量都相当重要，因此不推荐使用标准的 VTZ 基组。如果使用 "
"AVnZ、[A]VnZ-F12 或 VnZ-PP-F12 轨道基组，则会自动选择合适的密度拟合（DF）基组和分辨率恒等（RI）基组。对于 AVnZ "
"轨道基组，默认分别使用 AVnZ/MP2FIT 和 VnZ/JKFIT 基组作为 DF 和 RI 基组。可以通过指定 "
"``RI_BASIS=OPTRI`` 来选择 Peterson 等人关联的优化 CABS 基组。对于 [a]VnZ-F12 和 [a][c]VnZ-"
"PP-F12 轨道基组，默认使用关联的 CABS（OPTRI）基组。然而，OPTRI 基组尚未对所有元素都可用，在这种情况下，必须使用 "
"``RI_BASIS`` 选项明确指定替代的 RI 基组。"

msgid ""
"This is an example for using multiple basis sets for density fitting and "
"resolution of the identity"
msgstr "这是一个使用多个基组进行密度拟合和分辨率恒等的示例"

msgid "The following two examples yield identical results:"
msgstr "以下两个示例将得到相同的结果："

msgid ""
"In the latter example the specifications MP2FIT and JKFIT could be omitted, "
"i.e. the input"
msgstr "在后一个示例中，可以省略 MP2FIT 和 JKFIT 的指定，即输入"

msgid "``ccsd(t)-f12,df_basis=avtz,df_basis_exch=vtz,ri_basis=optri``"
msgstr "``ccsd(t)-f12,df_basis=avtz,df_basis_exch=vtz,ri_basis=optri``"

msgid ""
"would be equivalent. In fact, since default density fitting basis sets are "
"used"
msgstr "将是等效的。事实上，由于使用了默认的密度拟合基组"

msgid "``ccsd(t)-f12,ri_basis=optri``"
msgstr "``ccsd(t)-f12,ri_basis=optri``"

msgid ""
"would be sufficient. Note, however, that without the specification OPTRI the"
" avtz/jkfit basis set would be used for the RI. For example,"
msgstr "就足够了。但请注意，如果没有指定 OPTRI，则将使用 avtz/jkfit 基组进行 RI。例如，"

msgid "is equivalent to"
msgstr "等同于"

msgid ""
"If the VnZ-F12 basis sets are used, the OPTRI sets are used by default, "
"i.e.,"
msgstr "如果使用 VnZ-F12 基组，则默认使用 OPTRI 基组，即，"

msgid "Symmetry"
msgstr "对称性"

msgid ""
"Symmetry cannot be used in DF-LMP2-F12 calculations. However, in MP2-F12, "
"DF-MP2-F12, DF-RMP2-F12, CCSD(T)-F12 and UCCSD(T)-F12 calculations Abelian "
"symmetry can be used as usual; in these cases the preceding DF-MP2-F12 "
"calculations will be automatically performed without symmetry, and the "
"integrals that are necessary for subsequent CCSD-F12 or UCCSD-F12 "
"calculations will be transformed to the symmetry adapted basis. This is "
"fully automatic and transparent to the user. Note, however, that the prefix "
"DF- turns off symmetry automatically, and if you want to use symmetry in the"
" HF calculations preceding the DF-MP2-F12 or DF-MP2-F12 calculations the "
"symmetry elements (or ``AUTO``) must be specified using the ``SYMMETRY`` "
"directive (setting ``SYMMETRY,AUTO`` works fine)."
msgstr ""
"在 DF-LMP2-F12 计算中无法使用对称性。然而，在 MP2-F12、DF-MP2-F12、DF-RMP2-F12、CCSD(T)-F12 和 "
"UCCSD(T)-F12 计算中，阿贝尔对称性可以照常使用；在这些情况下，前面的 DF-MP2-F12 计算将自动在无对称性下执行，并且后续 "
"CCSD-F12 或 UCCSD-F12 计算所需的积分将被变换到对称性适配基组。这对用户来说是完全自动且透明的。但请注意，前缀 DF- "
"会自动关闭对称性，如果您希望在 DF-MP2-F12 或 DF-MP2-F12 计算之前的 HF 计算中使用对称性，则必须使用 ``SYMMETRY``"
" 指令指定对称元素（或 ``AUTO``\\ ）（设置 ``SYMMETRY,AUTO`` 即可）。"

msgid "Options"
msgstr "选项"

msgid ""
"There are many options available, but these are hardly needed. Normally, "
"when standard orbital basis sets such as aug-cc-PVTZ or VTZ-F12 are used, "
"appropriate defaults are used and no further options are needed. A typical "
"input simply reads"
msgstr ""
"有许多选项可用，但几乎不需要使用。通常，当使用标准轨道基组（如 aug-cc-PVTZ 或 "
"VTZ-F12）时，会使用适当的默认值，无需更多选项。典型的输入只需如下所示"

msgid ""
"We recommend to specify options only when necessary and when it is well "
"understood what they mean!"
msgstr "我们建议仅在必要时且充分理解其含义时才指定选项！"

msgid "Options for canonical and local versions:"
msgstr "正则版本和局域版本的选项："

msgid ""
"``DF_BASIS_EXCH=basis`` Select the density fitting basis for computing the "
"exchange and Fock operators. By default, the JKFIT basis sets which "
"correspond to the orbital basis are used."
msgstr ""
"``DF_BASIS_EXCH=basis`` 选择用于计算交换和 Fock 算符的密度拟合基组。默认情况下，使用与轨道基组对应的 JKFIT 基组。"

msgid ""
"``CONTEXT=context`` Can be used to change the default type for the RI basis,"
" e.g. ``CONTEXT=OPTRI`` will use the OPTRI basis sets that correspond to the"
" VnZ-F12 or AVnZ basis sets."
msgstr ""
"``CONTEXT=context`` 可用于更改RI基组的默认类型，例如，\\ ``CONTEXT=OPTRI`` "
"将使用与VnZ-F12或AVnZ基组对应的OPTRI基组。"

msgid ""
"``ANSATZ=ansatz`` Select the explicitly correlated ansatz *ansatz* methods. "
"See section `choosing the ansatz and the level of approximation "
"<explicitly_correlated_methods.html#choosing-the-ansatz-and-the-level-of-"
"approximation>`__ for the possibilities and further details."
msgstr ""
"``ANSATZ=ansatz`` 选择显式相关拟设 *ansatz* 方法。有关可能性和更多细节，请参阅章节 `选择拟设和近似级别 "
"<explicitly_correlated_methods.html#choosing-the-ansatz-and-the-level-of-"
"approximation>`__\\ 。"

msgid ""
"``GEM_BASIS`` Basis set name for geminal expansion; atom labels are ignored."
" This can either be ``OPTFULL`` (full nonlinear fit of the geminal "
"expansion), ``EVEN`` (even tempered fit), or refer to a set name defined in "
"a previous ``BASIS`` block. Default is ``OPTFULL``."
msgstr ""
"``GEM_BASIS`` 双电子展开的基组名称；忽略原子标签。可以是 ``OPTFULL``\\ （双电子展开的完全非线性拟合）、\\ "
"``EVEN``\\ （偶极调合拟合），或引用先前 ``BASIS`` 块中定义的集合名称。默认为 ``OPTFULL``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"``GEM_TYPE`` Frozen geminal type: ``LINEAR`` or ``SLATER``, default is "
"``SLATER``."
msgstr "``GEM_TYPE`` 冻结双电子类型：\\ ``LINEAR`` 或 ``SLATER``\\ ，默认为 ``SLATER``\\ 。"

msgid "``GEM_NUMBER`` Number of Gaussian geminal functions (default 6)."
msgstr "``GEM_NUMBER`` 高斯双电子函数的数量（默认6）。"

msgid ""
"``GEM_CENTRE`` Centre of even tempered geminal exponents, if "
"``GEM_BASIS=EVEN`` (default 1.0)."
msgstr "``GEM_CENTRE`` 偶极调合双电子指数的中心，如果 ``GEM_BASIS=EVEN``\\ （默认1.0）。"

msgid ""
"``GEM_RATIO`` Ratio of even tempered geminal exponents, if "
"``GEM_BASIS=EVEN`` (default 3.0)."
msgstr "``GEM_RATIO`` 偶极调合双电子指数的比率，如果 ``GEM_BASIS=EVEN``\\ （默认3.0）。"

msgid ""
"``GEM_BETA`` Exponent for Slater-type frozen geminal, or parameter for "
"weight function in other frozen geminal models (default 1.0 "
":math:`a_0^{-1}`). It is possible to specify extra exponents for core-core "
"and core-valence correlation. If two values are given (in square brackets), "
"the first is used for valence pairs, the second for core-core (cc) and core-"
"valence (cv) pairs. If three values are given, the first is used for vv, the"
" second for cv, and the third for cc correlation."
msgstr ""
"``GEM_BETA`` Slater型冻结对函数的指数，或其他冻结对函数模型中权重函数的参数（默认值 1.0 :math:`a_0^{-1}`\\ "
"）。可以为核-核和核-"
"价相关指定额外的指数。如果给出两个值（在方括号中），第一个用于价电子对，第二个用于核-核（cc）和核-价（cv）对。如果给出三个值，第一个用于vv相关，第二个用于cv相关，第三个用于cc相关。"

msgid ""
"``GEM_OMEGA`` Exponent for weighting function (default -1, which means a "
"value derived from ``GEM_BETA``)."
msgstr "``GEM_OMEGA`` 权重函数的指数（默认值 -1，表示一个从 ``GEM_BETA`` 推导出的值）。"

msgid "``GEM_MOM`` Exponent for r in omega fitting (default 0)."
msgstr "``GEM_MOM`` omega拟合中r的指数（默认值 0）。"

msgid "``GEM_M`` Exponent for r in weighting function (default 0)."
msgstr "``GEM_M`` 权重函数中r的指数（默认值 0）。"

msgid ""
"``GEM_MAXIT`` Max. number of iterations in geminal optimization (default "
"200)."
msgstr "``GEM_MAXIT`` 对函数优化中的最大迭代次数（默认值 200）。"

msgid "``GEM_PRINT`` Print parameter for geminal optimization (default 0)."
msgstr "``GEM_PRINT`` 对函数优化的打印参数（默认值 0）。"

msgid "``GEM_DEBUG`` Debug option for geminal optimization (default 0)."
msgstr "``GEM_DEBUG`` 对函数优化的调试选项（默认值 0）。"

msgid ""
"``GEM_ACC`` Convergence threshold for geminal line search (default 0.001)."
msgstr "``GEM_ACC`` 对函数线搜索的收敛阈值（默认值 0.001）。"

msgid ""
"``GEM_FAC`` Scaling factor for exponents in geminal optimization (default "
"1.0)."
msgstr "``GEM_FAC`` 用于 geminal 优化的指数标度因子（默认 1.0）。"

msgid ""
"``GEM_METHOD`` Geminal optimization method (augmented Hessian (``AH``) or "
"Newton-Raphson (``NR``), default ``AH``)."
msgstr ""
"``GEM_METHOD`` Geminal 优化方法（增广 Hessian (``AH``) 或 Newton-Raphson (``NR``)，默认"
" ``AH``\\ ）。"

msgid "``GEM_TRUST`` Trust ratio in AH geminal optimization (default 0.4)."
msgstr "``GEM_TRUST`` AH geminal 优化中的信任比（默认 0.4）。"

msgid "``GEM_SHIFT`` Hessian shift in AH geminal optimization (default 0)."
msgstr "``GEM_SHIFT`` AH geminal 优化中的 Hessian 矩阵位移（默认 0）。"

msgid ""
"``GEM_NUMERICAL`` Flags numerical integration in geminal optimization "
"(default 0)."
msgstr "``GEM_NUMERICAL`` 标记 geminal 优化中的数值积分（默认 0）。"

msgid "``GEM_PLOT`` Geminal plot file (default blank)."
msgstr "``GEM_PLOT`` Geminal 绘图文件（默认空白）。"

msgid ""
"``GEM_OPT_FULL`` If nonzero (default), fit each geminal independently to "
"Gaussians (if several exponents are used). If zero, the first exponent is "
"fitted, unless ``GEM_BETA_OPT`` is specified."
msgstr ""
"``GEM_OPT_FULL`` 如果非零（默认），将每个 geminal "
"独立拟合为高斯函数（如果使用多个指数）。如果为零，则拟合第一个指数，除非指定了 ``GEM_BETA_OPT``\\ 。"

msgid "``GEM_BETA_OPT`` Exponent used to fit the Gaussian expansion."
msgstr "``GEM_BETA_OPT`` 用于拟合高斯展开的指数。"

msgid ""
"``SIM_MULTGEM`` Only for calculation with multiple exponents: if nonzero, "
"loop externally over integral program for different exponents. This is "
"implied automatically if each geminal is fitted independently. If the same "
"Gaussian exponents are used for each Slater exponent, ``SIM_MULTGEM=0`` can "
"be used (default). In this case the integral program handles the general "
"contractions (slightly faster)."
msgstr ""
"``SIM_MULTGEM`` "
"仅用于多指数计算：若非零，则对不同指数在积分程序外部进行循环。如果每个拟设都独立拟合，则会自动隐含此设置。如果每个Slater指数使用相同的高斯指数，则可以使用"
" ``SIM_MULTGEM=0``\\ （默认值）。在这种情况下，积分程序处理广义收缩（稍快）。"

msgid "**ipri=0** Standard output"
msgstr "**ipri=0** 标准输出"

msgid ""
"**ipri=1** Standard output plus more detailed information about integral "
"evaluations."
msgstr "**ipri=1** 标准输出加上关于积分求值的更详细信息。"

msgid "**ipri=2** Debugging output"
msgstr "**ipri=2** 调试输出"

msgid ""
"``THRBINV`` Threshold below which non-physical eigenvalues are projected "
"from approximate B matrices"
msgstr "``THRBINV`` 低于此阈值的非物理特征值将从近似B矩阵中投影掉"

msgid "``THRAOF12`` Threshold for integral screening contribution."
msgstr "``THRAOF12`` 积分筛选贡献的阈值。"

msgid "Choosing the ansatz and the level of approximation"
msgstr "选择拟设和近似级别"

msgid ""
"The Ansatz can be chosen using the ``ANSATZ`` option and/or by options on "
"the command line."
msgstr "拟设可以通过 ``ANSATZ`` 选项和/或命令行选项来选择。"

msgid "``3A`` Ansatz 3A;"
msgstr "``3A`` 拟设 3A；"

msgid "``3*A`` Ansatz 3A with EBC approximation"
msgstr "``3*A`` 采用 EBC 近似的拟设 3A"

msgid "``3B`` Ansatz 3B"
msgstr "``3B`` 拟设 3B"

msgid "``3*B`` Ansatz 3B with EBC approximation"
msgstr "``3*B`` 采用 EBC 近似的拟设 3B"

msgid "``3C`` Ansatz 3C"
msgstr "``3C`` 拟设 3C"

msgid "``3*C`` Ansatz 3C with EBC approximation"
msgstr "``3*C`` 采用 EBC 近似的拟设 3C"

msgid ""
"The ansatz can be further detailed by appending options in parenthesis, e.g."
msgstr "拟设可以通过在括号内附加选项来进一步细化，例如，"

msgid "``ANSATZ=3B(D)``"
msgstr "``ANSATZ=3B(D)``"

msgid "These options can be one of"
msgstr "这些选项可以是以下之一"

msgid "``D`` Use diagonal ansatz"
msgstr "``D`` 使用对角拟设"

msgid "``FIX`` Use diagonal ansatz with fixed amplitudes (orbital invariant)"
msgstr "``FIX`` 使用具有固定振幅的对角拟设（轨道不变性）"

msgid ""
"``FIXC`` Use diagonal ansatz with fixed amplitudes and canonical orbitals"
msgstr "``FIXC`` 使用具有固定振幅和正则轨道的对角拟设"

msgid ""
"``DX`` Use diagonal ansatz and assume X-matrix to be diagonal (only for "
"Ansatz 3A)"
msgstr "``DX`` 使用对角拟设并假设X矩阵为对角矩阵（仅适用于拟设3A）"

msgid "``GBC`` Use GBC approximation (only for 3B, default in 3A)"
msgstr "``GBC`` 使用GBC近似（仅适用于3B，在3A中为默认）"

msgid "``EBC`` Use EBC approximation (same as \\*)"
msgstr "``EBC`` 使用EBC近似（与\\*相同）"

msgid "``HX1`` Use HX1 approximation (only for 3B)."
msgstr "``HX1`` 使用 HX1 近似（仅适用于 3B）。"

msgid "``HY1`` Use HY1 approximation (only for 3B and 3C)."
msgstr "``HY1`` 使用 HY1 近似（仅适用于 3B 和 3C）。"

msgid "``HY2`` Use HY2 approximation (only for 3B and 3C)."
msgstr "``HY2`` 使用 HY2 近似（仅适用于 3B 和 3C）。"

msgid ""
"``HY`` Default hybrid approximation. HX1 and HY2 approximation in 3B, HY2 in"
" 3C."
msgstr "``HY`` 默认混合近似。在 3B 中使用 HX1 和 HY2 近似，在 3C 中使用 HY2 近似。"

msgid "``NOZ`` Neglect Z terms (only for 3B and 3C)."
msgstr "``NOZ`` 忽略 Z 项（仅适用于 3B 和 3C）。"

msgid "``NOX`` Neglect X terms (only for 3A and 3B)."
msgstr "``NOX`` 忽略 X 项（仅适用于 3A 和 3B）。"

msgid "Several options separated by commas can be given. For instance"
msgstr "可以给出多个以逗号分隔的选项。例如"

msgid "``ANSATZ=3C(FIX,HY1)``"
msgstr "``ANSATZ=3C(FIX,HY1)``"

msgid ""
"uses the diagonal ansatz 3C(D) with fixed coefficients and the hybrid (HY1) "
"approximation."
msgstr "使用具有固定系数的对角拟设 3C(D) 和混合 (HY1) 近似。"

msgid ""
"Alternatively or in addition, the following options can be given on the "
"command line:"
msgstr "或者，也可以在命令行中给出以下选项："

msgid "``DIAG=1`` Use diagonal ansatz."
msgstr "``DIAG=1`` 使用对角拟设。"

msgid "``DIAGX=1`` Use diagonal ansatz and assume X-matrix to be diagonal."
msgstr "``DIAGX=1`` 使用对角拟设并假设 X 矩阵为对角矩阵。"

msgid "``GBC=1`` Use GBC approximation (only for 3B, default in 3A)."
msgstr "``GBC=1`` 使用 GBC 近似（仅适用于 3B，在 3A 中为默认）。"

msgid "``EBC=1`` Use EBC approximation (same as \\*)."
msgstr "``EBC=1`` 使用 EBC 近似（与 \\* 相同）。"

msgid "``HYBRID=n`` Use HYn approximation."
msgstr "``HYBRID=n`` 使用 HYn 近似。"

msgid "``HYBRIDX=1`` Use HX1 approximation."
msgstr "``HYBRIDX=1`` 使用 HX1 近似。"

msgid "``NOZ=1`` Neglect Z terms (only 3B and 3C)."
msgstr "``NOZ=1`` 忽略 Z 项（仅保留 3B 和 3C）。"

msgid "``NOX=1`` Neglect X terms (only 3A and 3B)."
msgstr "``NOX=1`` 忽略 X 项（仅保留 3A 和 3B）。"

msgid ""
"``FIX=1`` Use diagonal ansatz with fixed coefficient approximation (orbital "
"invariant)."
msgstr "``FIX=1`` 使用具有固定系数近似的对角拟设（轨道不变性）。"

msgid ""
"``FIX=2`` Use diagonal ansatz with fixed coefficient approximation. Evaluate"
" only first order energy expression, not the Hylleraas functional. Very fast"
" but less accurate and reliable!"
msgstr "``FIX=2`` 使用具有固定系数近似的对角拟设。仅计算一阶能量表达式，而非 Hylleraas 泛函。速度极快，但精度和可靠性较低！"

msgid ""
"``FIXCAN=1`` Use diagonal ansatz with fixed coefficient approximation and "
"canonical orbitals. A non-iterative method is used to evaluate the energy. "
"This is equivalent to ``FIX=1,CANONICAL=1`` and is most efficient."
msgstr ""
"``FIXCAN=1`` 使用具有固定系数近似和正则轨道的对角拟设。采用非迭代方法计算能量。这等价于 ``FIX=1,CANONICAL=1`` "
"且效率最高。"

msgid ""
"``FIXCAN=-1`` As ``FIXCAN=1``, but equations are solved iteratively (test "
"purpose only)."
msgstr "``FIXCAN=-1`` 与 ``FIXCAN=1`` 相同，但方程通过迭代求解（仅用于测试目的）。"

msgid ""
"``CABS=1`` Use CABS (default). If ``CABS=0`` is given, CABS is disabled. "
"However, if ``RI_BASIS=OPTRI``, the orbital and OPTRI basis sets are "
"automatically merged, and then exactly the same results as with ``CABS=1`` "
"are obtained."
msgstr ""
"``CABS=1`` 使用 CABS（默认）。若指定 ``CABS=0``\\ ，则禁用 CABS。然而，若 ``RI_BASIS=OPTRI``\\ "
"，轨道基组和 OPTRI 基组会自动合并，从而得到与 ``CABS=1`` 完全相同的结果。"

msgid ""
"``ORTHO_CABS=1`` Construct CABS basis from orthogonal MOs and ABS basis "
"rather than AO and RI basis."
msgstr "``ORTHO_CABS=1`` 从正交分子轨道和 ABS 基组（而非原子轨道和 RI 基组）构建 CABS 基组。"

msgid ""
"``SOLVE=0`` Use a most efficient pair-specific fully iterative method "
"(default)."
msgstr "``SOLVE=0`` 使用最高效的、针对电子对特定的完全迭代方法（默认）。"

msgid "``SOLVE=1`` Use simple fully iterative method."
msgstr "``SOLVE=1`` 使用简单的完全迭代方法。"

msgid "``SOLVE=2`` Use pair specific iterative method (more expensive)."
msgstr "``SOLVE=2`` 使用针对电子对特定的迭代方法（计算成本更高）。"

msgid ""
"``SOLVE=3`` Use pair specific non iterative method (most expensive, only "
"with canonical orbitals)."
msgstr "``SOLVE=3`` 使用轨道对特定的非迭代方法（最昂贵，仅适用于正则轨道）。"

msgid "``CANONICAL=1`` Use canonical orbitals and full domains."
msgstr "``CANONICAL=1`` 使用正则轨道和完全域。"

msgid ""
"``DOMSEL=1`` Use full domains and localized orbitals (unless ``CANONICAL=1``"
" is given)."
msgstr "``DOMSEL=1`` 使用完全域和定域轨道（除非指定了 ``CANONICAL=1``\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"``SCALE_TRIP=1`` Scale triples energy as explained in section `CCSD(T)-F12 "
"<explicitly_correlated_methods.html#ccsd-t-f12>`__."
msgstr ""
"``SCALE_TRIP=1`` 按章节 `CCSD(T)-F12 <explicitly_correlated_methods.html#ccsd-"
"t-f12>`__ 中的说明缩放三重激发能。"

msgid ""
"``CABS_SINGLES`` If set to one, include CABS singles correction (default=1)"
msgstr "``CABS_SINGLES`` 如果设为 1，则包含 CABS 单激发修正（默认=1）"

msgid ""
"``CORE_SINGLES`` If set to one, include CABS singles correction for core "
"orbitals (default=0)"
msgstr "``CORE_SINGLES`` 如果设为 1，则包含针对芯轨道的 CABS 单激发修正（默认=0）"

msgid ""
"``EXTGEN`` For open-shell systems: If 1 (default,recommended), include all "
"occupied valence orbital pairs for :math:`mn` in :math:`T^{ij}_{mn}`, "
"independent of spin (as described in `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3054300>`__ **130**, 054104 (2009), section "
"II.E). If 0, use only pairs mn where the spins of :math:`i` and :math:`m`, "
"and :math:`j` and :math:`n` are equal."
msgstr ""
"``EXTGEN`` 对于开壳层体系：如果为 1（默认，推荐），则包含 :math:`T^{ij}_{mn}` 中 :math:`mn` "
"的所有占据价层轨道对，与自旋无关（如 `J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3054300>`__"
" **130**, 054104 (2009) 第 II.E 节所述）。如果为 0，则仅使用 :math:`i` 与 :math:`m`\\ 、以及 "
":math:`j` 与 :math:`n` 自旋相等的轨道对 mn。"

msgid "For instance"
msgstr "例如"

msgid "``ANSATZ=3C,fix=1,hybrid=1,canonical=1``"
msgstr "``ANSATZ=3C,fix=1,hybrid=1,canonical=1``"

msgid ""
"Note that the HF convergence threshold should be rather strict to obtain "
"accurate results (use ``ACCU,14`` in the HF)."
msgstr "请注意，为了获得准确的结果，HF 收敛阈值应相当严格（在 HF 中使用 ``ACCU,14``\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"Numerous further options are for specialist use only and not described here."
" See ``explicit.registry`` for a full list."
msgstr "许多进一步的选项仅供专家使用，此处不作描述。完整列表请参见 ``explicit.registry``\\ 。"

msgid "CABS Singles correction"
msgstr "CABS 单激发修正"

msgid ""
"The singles correction can be turned off by option ``CABS_SINGLES=0``, e.g."
msgstr "可以通过选项 ``CABS_SINGLES=0`` 关闭单激发修正，例如"

msgid "``MP2-F12,CABS_SINGLES=0``"
msgstr "``MP2-F12,CABS_SINGLES=0``"

msgid ""
"One can use the MP2-F12 or RMP2-F12 program to only compute the cabs singles"
" correction using ``CABS_SINGLES=-1``. In this case the program exits after "
"computing the correction. This can be useful for using the singles "
"correction in subsequent local correlation calculations. It is stored in "
"variable ``EF12_RHFRELAX``. This can also be done by the commands ``CABS`` "
"or ``DF-CABS``."
msgstr ""
"可以使用 MP2-F12 或 RMP2-F12 程序，通过 ``CABS_SINGLES=-1`` 仅计算 cabs "
"单激发修正。在这种情况下，程序在计算完修正后退出。这对于在后续的局域相关计算中使用单激发修正可能很有用。它存储在变量 ``EF12_RHFRELAX``"
" 中。这也可以通过命令 ``CABS`` 或 ``DF-CABS`` 来完成。"

msgid ""
"The contribution of core orbitals to the singles energy is not included by "
"default, but can be turned on by option ``CORE_SINGLES``, e.g."
msgstr "芯轨道对单激发能量的贡献默认不包括在内，但可以通过选项 ``CORE_SINGLES`` 开启，例如"

msgid "``MP2-F12,CORE_SINGLES=1``"
msgstr "``MP2-F12,CORE_SINGLES=1``"

msgid ""
"However, we do not recommended the use of core singles, because they depend "
"sensitively on the CABS basis construction and do not offer significant "
"improvements in relative energies."
msgstr "然而，我们不推荐使用芯轨道单激发修正，因为它们对 CABS 基组的构建非常敏感，并且不能显著改善相对能量。"

msgid "The cabs-singles correction can also be computed using the command"
msgstr "cabs 单激发修正也可以使用命令"

msgid "``DF-CABS``"
msgstr "``DF-CABS``"

msgid ""
"This is equivalent to ``DF-MP2-F12,CABS_SINGLES=-1``, which means that only "
"the CABS correction is computed."
msgstr "这等价于 ``DF-MP2-F12,CABS_SINGLES=-1``\\ ，意味着仅计算 CABS 校正。"

msgid ""
"By default, a two-step orthonormalization procedure is used to compute the "
"CABS basis. A simplified 1-step version can be chosen using option  ``ORTHO-"
"CABS=0`` (this is the default in the PNO-F12 program). The effect on "
"relative energies is usually negligible."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，使用两步正交化程序来计算 CABS 基组。可以使用选项 ``ORTHO-CABS=0`` 选择简化的一步版本（这是 PNO-F12 "
"程序中的默认设置）。对相对能量的影响通常可以忽略不计。"

msgid "Pair specific geminal exponents"
msgstr "对特定的双电子指数"

msgid ""
"Different Slater exponents can be used for core-core, core-valence and "
"valence-valence pairs as described in H.-J. Werner, G. Knizia, and F. R. "
"Manby, `Mol. Phys. <https://doi.org/10.1080/00268976.2010.526641>`__ "
"**109**, 407 (2011). The exponents are specified using the ``GEM_BETA`` "
"option, e.g., ``GEM_BETA=[1.0, 1.7, 2.5]`` (see options, section `options "
"<explicitly_correlated_methods.html#options>`__). The three values are used "
"for vv, cv, cc pairs, respectively. In most cases, core pairs can be defined"
" by using the ``CORE`` directive: all orbitals that are not core and do not "
"belong to the default valence shell are then treated as core. If part of the"
" default valence shell is to be taken as core (e.g., the 3d shell in first-"
"row transition metals), the core can be defined via the ``PRCORE`` variable,"
" e.g., ``prcore=[4,2,2,1,4,2,2,1]`` for Cu\\ :math:`_2`. This variable must "
"then be defined before the F12 calculation that should use it. The following"
" example shows calculation for Br\\ :math:`_2`, in which the :math:`3d` "
"shell is treated as core."
msgstr ""
"如 H.-J. Werner, G. Knizia 和 F. R. Manby 在 `Mol. Phys. "
"<https://doi.org/10.1080/00268976.2010.526641>`__ **109**, 407 (2011) "
"中所述，可以对核-核、核-价和价-价电子对使用不同的 Slater 指数。这些指数通过 ``GEM_BETA`` 选项指定，例如 "
"``GEM_BETA=[1.0, 1.7, 2.5]``\\ （参见选项，章节 `options "
"<explicitly_correlated_methods.html#options>`__\\ ）。这三个值分别用于 vv、cv、cc "
"电子对。在大多数情况下，可以通过使用 ``CORE`` "
"指令来定义核电子对：所有不属于核且不属于默认价壳层的轨道随后被视为核轨道。如果默认价壳层的一部分需要被视为核（例如，第一行过渡金属的 3d "
"壳层），可以通过 ``PRCORE`` 变量来定义核，例如，对于 Cu\\ :math:`_2` 使用 "
"``prcore=[4,2,2,1,4,2,2,1]``\\ 。然后必须在应使用它的 F12 计算之前定义此变量。以下示例显示了 Br\\ "
":math:`_2` 的计算，其中 :math:`3d` 壳层被视为核。"

msgid "CCSD(T)-F12"
msgstr "CCSD(T)-F12"

msgid ""
"The CCSD-F12 and UCCSD-F12 programs first do DF-MP2-F12/3C(FIX) (closed-"
"shell) or DF-RMP2-F12/3C(FIX) (open-shell) calculations, and then perform "
"the CCSD-F12 (UCCSD-F12) without density fitting. By default, the CCSD-F12A "
"and CCSD-F12B energies are both computed. A specific method can be requested"
" by appending A or B to the -F12 suffix. Furthermore, instead of the 3C(FIX)"
" ansatz, different ansätze (e.g. 3C) can be used. In this case the "
"amplitudes of the explicitly correlated terms are determined in the MP2-F12 "
"calculation and kept fixed in the CCSD-F12."
msgstr ""
"CCSD-F12 和 UCCSD-F12 程序首先进行 DF-MP2-F12/3C(FIX)（闭壳层）或 DF-"
"RMP2-F12/3C(FIX)（开壳层）计算，然后执行 CCSD-F12（UCCSD-F12）而不使用密度拟合。默认情况下，会同时计算 "
"CCSD-F12A 和 CCSD-F12B 能量。可以通过在 -F12 后缀后附加 A 或 B 来请求特定方法。此外，可以使用不同的拟设（例如 "
"3C）来代替 3C(FIX) 拟设。在这种情况下，显式相关项的振幅在 MP2-F12 计算中确定，并在 CCSD-F12 中保持固定。"

msgid ""
"It should be noted that these methods involve approximations and do not "
"yield the exact CCSD-F12 energies. Preliminary experience has shown that the"
" CCSD-F12A method slightly overestimates the correlation energies, while "
"CCSD-F12B underestimates them. For AVDZ or AVTZ basis sets, CCSD-F12A "
"usually gives very good results, but for larger basis sets it may "
"overestimate the basis set limit and converge from below to the limit. Thus,"
" convergence may not be monotonic, and extrapolation of the correlation "
"energies should not be attempted. CCSD-F12B usually converges monotonically "
"from below to the limit and gives best results for AVQZ and larger basis "
"sets. Thus, we currently recommend CCSD-F12A for AVDZ and AVTZ basis sets, "
"and CCSD-F12B for larger basis sets (rarely needed)."
msgstr ""
"应当注意，这些方法涉及近似，不会产生精确的 CCSD-F12 能量。初步经验表明，CCSD-F12A 方法略微高估了相关能，而 CCSD-F12B "
"则低估了它们。对于 AVDZ 或 AVTZ 基组，CCSD-F12A "
"通常给出非常好的结果，但对于更大的基组，它可能会高估基组极限并从下方收敛到极限。因此，收敛可能不是单调的，不应尝试对相关能进行外推。CCSD-F12B "
"通常从下方单调收敛到极限，并为 AVQZ 及更大的基组提供最佳结果。因此，我们目前推荐对 AVDZ 和 AVTZ 基组使用 "
"CCSD-F12A，对更大的基组（很少需要）使用 CCSD-F12B。"

msgid ""
"The perturbative triples correction can be invoked by using CCSD(T)-F12 or "
"UCCSD(T)-F12. There is no direct F12 correction to the triples, and "
"therefore the basis set error of the triples is not affected by the F12 "
"(small changes of the triples energy arise from the fact that the doubles "
"amplitudes are affected by the F12 terms). In many cases, a simple and "
"pragmatic improvement of the triples energy can be obtained by scaling the "
"triples energy contribution as"
msgstr ""
"通过使用 CCSD(T)-F12 或 UCCSD(T)-F12 可以调用微扰三重激发校正。三重激发没有直接的 F12 校正，因此三重激发的基组误差不受 "
"F12 影响（三重激发能的微小变化源于双激发振幅受到 F12 "
"项的影响）。在许多情况下，可以通过按比例缩放三重激发能贡献来简单且实用地改进三重激发能，公式如下"

msgid ""
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\Delta E_{(T*)} &=& \\Delta E_{(T)}*E_{corr}^{MP2-F12}/E_{corr}^{MP2} \\nonumber\\end{aligned}"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\Delta E_{(T\\ *)} &=& \\Delta E_{(T)}*\\ E_{corr}^{MP2-F12}/E_{corr}^{MP2} \\nonumber\\end{aligned}"

msgid ""
"This can be done automatically by setting option ``SCALE_TRIP=1``, i.e."
msgstr "\\ 这可以通过设置选项 ``SCALE_TRIP=1`` 来自动完成，即"

msgid "``CCSD(T)-F12,SCALE_TRIP=1``"
msgstr "``CCSD(T)-F12,SCALE_TRIP=1``"

msgid "Perturbative F12 correction"
msgstr "微扰 F12 校正"

msgid ""
"F12 can be used together with the Brueckner and orbital-optimized CCD and "
"DCD methods as described in D. Kats and D. P. Tew, JCTC **15**, 13 (2019)."
msgstr ""
"F12 可以与 Brueckner 和轨道优化的 CCD 及 DCD 方法结合使用，如 D. Kats 和 D. P. Tew, JCTC "
"**15**, 13 (2019) 中所述。"

msgid ""
"For this, first a standard Brueckner or orbital optimized CCD or DCD "
"calculation is performed, and the orbitals and amplitudes are stored. After "
"converting the orbital record to the normal HF-type record by using "
"``hf,maxit=0``, the orbitals and the amplitudes are read in by the "
"corresponding CCSD-F12 or DCSD-F12 method with an option ``pertcalc`` set to"
" 1 (use contravariant amplitudes instead of the Lagrange multipliers) or 2 "
"(use true Lagrange multipliers – possible only for orbital-optimized methods"
" and recommended). The final energy is printed together with a relaxation "
"correction, which yields results closer to the fully relaxed F12 treatment, "
"and the uncorrected value is printed in the next line."
msgstr ""
"为此，首先执行标准的 Brueckner 或轨道优化的 CCD 或 DCD 计算，并存储轨道和振幅。然后通过使用 ``hf,maxit=0`` "
"将轨道记录转换为正常的 HF 类型记录后，相应的 CCSD-F12 或 DCSD-F12 方法会读取这些轨道和振幅，并设置选项 ``pertcalc``"
" 为 1（使用逆变振幅代替拉格朗日乘子）或 "
"2（使用真正的拉格朗日乘子——仅适用于轨道优化方法且推荐使用）。最终能量会与一个弛豫校正值一起打印，该校正使结果更接近完全弛豫的 F12 "
"处理，而未校正的值将在下一行打印。"

msgid ""
"It is advisable to set the ``SHIFTS`` and ``SHIFTP`` options to zero (and "
"use the imaginary level shift ``SHIFTSI`` and ``SHIFTPI`` if needed). The "
"option ``nofai_singles``\\ =0 can be set to use the full Fock matrix in the "
"CABS singles correction and the singles residual, which takes the final "
"energy closer to the CCSD/DCSD CBS results. If the iterative MP2 struggles "
"to converge, one can set ``shiftimp2`` to a very large number (e.g., 1000)."
msgstr ""
"建议将 ``SHIFTS`` 和 ``SHIFTP`` 选项设为零（如果需要，可使用虚能级位移 ``SHIFTSI`` 和 ``SHIFTPI``\\ "
"）。可以设置选项 ``nofai_singles``\\ =0 以在 CABS 单激发修正和单激发残差中使用完整的 Fock 矩阵，这会使最终能量更接近"
" CCSD/DCSD CBS 结果。如果迭代 MP2 难以收敛，可以将 ``shiftimp2`` 设置为一个非常大的数（例如，1000）。"

msgid "Example:"
msgstr "示例："

msgid "DF-LMP2-F12 and DF-LCCSD(T)-F12 calculations with local approximations"
msgstr "采用局域近似的 DF-LMP2-F12 和 DF-LCCSD(T)-F12 计算"

msgid ""
"``USEVRT`` If zero, the :math:`1-pp+po+op-p'o-op'` form of the projector is "
"used, and local RI approximations apply to :math:`p` and :math:`p'`. If set "
"to 1, the :math:`1+oo-vv-p'o-op'` form of the projector is used; any local "
"RI approximation then applies only to the RI contribution :math:`p'`."
msgstr ""
"``USEVRT`` 如果为零，则使用投影算子的 :math:`1-pp+po+op-p'o-op'` 形式，并且局域 RI 近似适用于 "
":math:`p` 和 :math:`p'`\\ 。如果设置为 1，则使用投影算子的 :math:`1+oo-vv-p'o-op'` 形式；任何局域 "
"RI 近似则仅适用于 RI 贡献 :math:`p'`\\ 。"

msgid ""
"``USEPAO`` If ``USEPAO=1`` use pair-specific local projectors instead of "
":math:`vv`. This is the default if either the ansatz contains ’(LOC)’ or if "
"domain approximations are made in the LMP2 (i.e., ``DOMSEL<1`` is explicitly"
" specified). Otherwise the default is ``USEPAO=0``. ``USEPAO=1`` "
"automatically implies ``USEVRT=1``, i.e. local RI approximations only affect"
" the RI contributions :math:`p'`. Furthermore, if ``USEPAO=1`` is specified "
"and ``DOMSEL`` is not given, default domains are assumed in the LMP2. If "
"``USEPAO=0``, full domains (``DOMSEL=1``) will be used."
msgstr ""
"``USEPAO`` 如果 ``USEPAO=1``\\ ，则使用对特定的局域投影子代替 :math:`vv`\\ 。如果拟设包含'(LOC)'或在 "
"LMP2 中进行了域近似（即显式指定了 ``DOMSEL<1``\\ ），则此为默认设置。否则默认值为 ``USEPAO=0``\\ 。\\ "
"``USEPAO=1`` 自动意味着 ``USEVRT=1``\\ ，即局域 RI 近似仅影响 RI 贡献 :math:`p'`\\ 。此外，如果指定了"
" ``USEPAO=1`` 但未给出 ``DOMSEL``\\ ，则在 LMP2 中假定使用默认域。如果 ``USEPAO=0``\\ "
"，将使用完全域（\\ ``DOMSEL=1``\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"``FULLAO`` if ``USEVRT=0`` and ``FULLAO=1``, local RI approximations only "
"apply to the RI contributions :math:`p'`. This should give the same results "
"as ``USEVRT=1`` (only applies if ``USEPAO=0``)."
msgstr ""
"``FULLAO`` 如果 ``USEVRT=0`` 且 ``FULLAO=1``\\ ，则局域 RI 近似仅适用于 RI 贡献 "
":math:`p'`\\ 。这应给出与 ``USEVRT=1`` 相同的结果（仅当 ``USEPAO=0`` 时适用）。"

msgid "``DEBUG`` Parameter for debug print"
msgstr "``DEBUG`` 调试打印参数"

msgid ""
"``LOCFIT_F12`` If set to one, use local fitting. Default is no local fitting"
" (``LOCFIT_F12=0``)"
msgstr "``LOCFIT_F12`` 如果设置为 1，则使用局域拟合。默认不使用局域拟合（\\ ``LOCFIT_F12=0``\\ ）"

msgid ""
"``LOCFIT_R12`` Alias for ``LOCFIT_F12``. Local fitting is not recommended in"
" R12 calculations."
msgstr "``LOCFIT_R12`` ``LOCFIT_F12`` 的别名。在 R12 计算中不推荐使用局域拟合。"

msgid ""
"``RDOMAUX`` Distance criterion for density fitting domain extensions in case"
" of local fitting. The default depends on ``FITDOM``."
msgstr "``RDOMAUX`` 局域拟合情况下密度拟合域扩展的距离判据。默认值取决于 ``FITDOM``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"``IDOMAUX`` Connectivity criterion for density fitting domain extensions in "
"case of local fitting."
msgstr "``IDOMAUX`` 局域拟合情况下密度拟合域扩展的连通性判据。"

msgid ""
"``RAODOM`` Distance criterion for RI domain extensions. Zero means full RI "
"basis (default). If ``USEPAO=1`` or ``USEVRT=1`` or ``FULLAO=1`` a value of "
"5 bohr is recommended. In other cases the local RI domains must be very "
"large (``RAODOM>12``) and the use of local RI approximations is not "
"recommended."
msgstr ""
"``RAODOM`` RI 域扩展的距离判据。零表示使用完全的 RI 基组（默认）。如果 ``USEPAO=1`` 或 ``USEVRT=1`` 或 "
"``FULLAO=1``\\ ，推荐值为 5 玻尔。在其他情况下，局域 RI 域必须非常大（\\ ``RAODOM>12``\\ ），因此不推荐使用局域"
" RI 近似。"

msgid ""
"``IAODOM`` Connectivity criterion for RI domain extensions. Zero means full "
"RI basis (default). Values greater or equal to 2 should lead to sufficiently"
" accurate results, provided the local projector (``USEPAO=1``) is used."
msgstr ""
"``IAODOM`` RI 域扩展的连通性判据。零表示使用完全的 RI 基组（默认）。如果使用了局域投影器（\\ ``USEPAO=1``\\ "
"），大于或等于 2 的值应能产生足够精确的结果。"

msgid ""
"``THRAO`` Screening threshold for coulomb integrals in the AO or RI basis."
msgstr "``THRAO`` AO 或 RI 基组中库仑积分的筛选阈值。"

msgid "``THRAOF12`` Screening threshold for F12 integrals."
msgstr "``THRAOF12`` F12 积分的筛选阈值。"

msgid "``THRMO`` Screening threshold for half transformed integrals."
msgstr "``THRMO`` 半变换积分的筛选阈值。"

msgid ""
"``THRPROD`` Product screening threshold in the first half transformation."
msgstr "``THRPROD`` 第一次半变换中的乘积筛选阈值。"

msgid ""
"``NOMP2`` If set to 1, only the F12 calculation is performed, and the LMP2 "
"is skipped. This is sometimes useful if full domains are used, since the "
"iterative LMP2 then causes a big overhead and needs a lot of memory. It is "
"then more efficient to do the a DF-MP2 calculation separately and compute "
"the total energy as the sum of the DF-MP2 energy and the F12 energy"
msgstr ""
"``NOMP2`` 如果设置为 1，则仅执行 F12 计算，并跳过 LMP2。这在有时使用完全域时很有用，因为迭代的 LMP2 "
"会产生很大的开销并需要大量内存。此时，更高效的做法是单独进行 DF-MP2 计算，并将总能量计算为 DF-MP2 能量与 F12 能量之和。"

msgid ""
"``PROJF`` Values greater than 0 invoke the local projector. ``PROJF=1`` "
"project vv parts only (this is formally the most accurate case but only "
"possible with the canonical program [``ANSATZ=3*A(FIX,NOX)``], ``PROJF=2`` "
"project vv and vo parts (default). This is unavoidable if the local program "
"is used [``ANSATZ=3*A(LOC)``]."
msgstr ""
"``PROJF`` 大于 0 的值会调用局域投影器。\\ ``PROJF=1`` 仅投影 vv "
"部分（这在形式上是精度最高的情形，但仅在使用正则程序时可能 [``ANSATZ=3*A(FIX,NOX)``]），\\ ``PROJF=2`` 投影 "
"vv 和 vo 部分（默认）。如果使用局域程序 [``ANSATZ=3*A(LOC)``]，则此设置是不可避免的。"

msgid ""
"``MODOMC`` If :math:`\\gt 0`, core contributions are neglected in the "
"projector. This is a necessary approximation in order to compute the "
"LCCSD-F12 coupling terms efficiently (implementation not yet finished). "
"Setting ``MODOMC=0`` avoids the approximation. Note that the results in `J. "
"Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3647565>`__ **135**, 144117 (2011)"
" have been obtained using ``MODOMC=0``."
msgstr ""
"``MODOMC`` 如果 :math:`\\gt 0`\\ ，则在投影子中忽略核贡献。这是为了高效计算 LCCSD-F12 "
"耦合项所必需的一个近似（实现尚未完成）。设置 ``MODOMC=0`` 可避免此近似。请注意，\\ `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3647565>`__ **135**, 144117 (2011) 中的结果是使用 "
"``MODOMC=0`` 获得的。"

msgid "Typical inputs for calculations with local approximations are:"
msgstr "使用局域近似计算的典型输入示例如下："

msgid ""
"This would perform a local MP2 with a Boughton-Pulay domain completeness "
"criterion of 0.985. In the F12 part, distant pairs are not included "
"(``PAIRS=WEAK``) and the local projector is used (``USEPAO=1``, default). "
"Local density fitting and local RI approximations are used."
msgstr ""
"这将执行一个 Boughton-Pulay 域完备性判据为 0.985 的局域 MP2 计算。在 F12 部分中，不包含远对（\\ "
"``PAIRS=WEAK``\\ ）并使用局域投影子（\\ ``USEPAO=1``\\ ，默认）。使用了局域密度拟合和局域 RI 近似。"

msgid ""
"A corresponding non-local calculation (still using localized orbitals and "
"the diagonal ansatz) would be"
msgstr "一个对应的非局域计算（仍使用定域轨道和对角拟设）将是"

msgid ""
"Note: The use of local DF and RI domains is still experimental and should be"
" use with care!"
msgstr "注意：局域 DF 和 RI 域的使用仍处于实验阶段，应谨慎使用！"

msgid "Variables set by the F12 programs"
msgstr "由 F12 程序设置的变量"

msgid "The following variables are set by the F12 programs:"
msgstr "以下变量由 F12 程序设置："

msgid ""
"``ENERGR`` Reference energy. This includes the perturbative CABS singles "
"correction if computed."
msgstr "``ENERGR`` 参考能量。如果计算了，这包括微扰 CABS 单激发修正。"

msgid ""
"``ENERGY`` Total energy of the requested method (including the F12 and "
"singles corrections). ``ENERGY(1)`` and ``ENERGY(2)`` hold the F12A and F12B"
" values, respectively (if both are computed)."
msgstr ""
"``ENERGY`` 所请求方法的总能量（包括 F12 和单激发修正）。\\ ``ENERGY(1)`` 和 ``ENERGY(2)`` 分别保存 "
"F12A 和 F12B 的值（如果两者都计算了）。"

msgid ""
"``ENERGC`` Total CCSD-F12 energies in ccsd-f12 or uccsd-f12 calculations. "
"``ENERGC(1)`` and ``ENERGC(2)`` hold the F12A and F12B values, respectively "
"(if both are computed). The difference of ``ENERGY`` and ``ENERGC`` is the "
"triples energy contribution."
msgstr ""
"``ENERGC`` ccsd-f12 或 uccsd-f12 计算中的总 CCSD-F12 能量。\\ ``ENERGC(1)`` 和 "
"``ENERGC(2)`` 分别保存 F12A 和 F12B 的值（如果两者都计算了）。\\ ``ENERGY`` 与 ``ENERGC`` "
"的差值即为三重激发能贡献。"

msgid ""
"``ENERGT`` Triples energy contribution. This is a vector. The corresponding "
"methods are stored in ``METHODT`` (strings)."
msgstr "``ENERGT`` 三重激发能贡献。这是一个向量。对应的方法存储在 ``METHODT``\\ （字符串）中。"

msgid ""
"``EMP2`` Total MP2 energy (excluding F12 correction, but including the "
"singles correction)."
msgstr "``EMP2`` 总 MP2 能量（不包括 F12 校正，但包括单激发修正）。"

msgid ""
"``EMP2_SCS`` Total SCS-MP2 energy (excluding F12 correction, but including "
"the singles correction)."
msgstr "``EMP2_SCS`` 总 SCS-MP2 能量（不包括 F12 校正，但包括单激发修正）。"

msgid ""
"``EMP2_SING`` Singlet MP2 correlation energy (excluding F12 correction)."
msgstr "``EMP2_SING`` 单重态 MP2 相关能（不包括 F12 校正）。"

msgid ""
"``EMP2_TRIP`` Triplet MP2 correlation energy (excluding F12 correction)."
msgstr "``EMP2_TRIP`` 三重态 MP2 相关能（不包括 F12 校正）。"

msgid ""
"``EMP2_STRONG`` Strong pair contribution to the LMP2 correlation energy "
"(where applicable)."
msgstr "``EMP2_STRONG`` 对 LMP2 相关能的强对贡献（如适用）。"

msgid ""
"``EMP2_CLOSE`` Close pair contribution to the LMP2 correlation energy (where"
" applicable)."
msgstr "``EMP2_CLOSE`` 对 LMP2 相关能的近对贡献（如适用）。"

msgid ""
"``EMP2_WEAK`` Weak pair contribution to the LMP2 correlation energy (where "
"applicable)."
msgstr "``EMP2_WEAK`` 对 LMP2 相关能的弱对贡献（如适用）。"

msgid ""
"``EMP2_DIST`` Distant pair F12 contribution to the LMP2-F12 correlation "
"energy (where applicable)."
msgstr "``EMP2_DIST`` 对 LMP2-F12 相关能的远对 F12 贡献（如适用）。"

msgid ""
"``EF12`` F12 contribution to the MP2-F12 correlation energy for the "
"requested ansatz."
msgstr "``EF12`` 对所请求拟设的 MP2-F12 相关能的 F12 贡献。"

msgid ""
"``EF12S`` F12 contribution to the MP2-F12 correlation energy using EBC "
"approximation for the requested ansatz."
msgstr "``EF12S`` 使用 EBC 近似对所请求拟设的 MP2-F12 相关能的 F12 贡献。"

msgid ""
"``EF12D`` F12 contribution to the MP2-F12 correlation energy using EBC "
"approximation and diagonal (DX) approximation for the requested ansatz."
msgstr "``EF12D`` 使用 EBC 近似和对角 (DX) 近似对所请求拟设的 MP2-F12 相关能的 F12 贡献。"

msgid ""
"``EF12_SING`` Singlet F12 contribution to the MP2-F12 correlation energy for"
" the requested ansatz."
msgstr "``EF12_SING`` 对所请求拟设的 MP2-F12 相关能的单重态 F12 贡献。"

msgid ""
"``EF12_TRIP`` Triplet F12 contribution to the MP2-F12 correlation energy for"
" the requested ansatz."
msgstr "``EF12_TRIP`` 对所请求拟设的 MP2-F12 相关能的三重态 F12 贡献。"

msgid ""
"``EF12_STRONG`` Strong pair F12 contribution to the LMP2-F12 correlation "
"energy (where applicable)."
msgstr "``EF12_STRONG`` 对 LMP2-F12 相关能的强对 F12 贡献（如适用）。"

msgid ""
"``EF12_CLOSE`` Close pair F12 contribution to the LMP2-F12 correlation "
"energy (where applicable)."
msgstr "``EF12_CLOSE`` 对 LMP2-F12 相关能的近对 F12 贡献（如适用）。"

msgid ""
"``EF12_WEAK`` Weak pair F12 contribution to the LMP2-F12 correlation energy "
"(where applicable)."
msgstr "``EF12_WEAK`` 对 LMP2-F12 相关能的弱对 F12 贡献（如适用）。"

msgid ""
"``EF12_DIST`` Distant pair F12 contribution to the LMP2-F12 correlation "
"energy (where applicable)."
msgstr "``EF12_DIST`` 对 LMP2-F12 相关能的远对 F12 贡献（如适用）。"

msgid ""
"``EF12_SCS`` F12 contribution to the MP2-F12 correlation energy for the "
"requested ansatz."
msgstr "``EF12_SCS`` 对所请求拟设的 MP2-F12 相关能的 F12 贡献。"

msgid ""
"``EF12_SINGLES`` Total CABS singles contribution (in closed-shell case equal"
" to ``EF12_RHFRELAX``)."
msgstr "``EF12_SINGLES`` 总的 CABS 单激发贡献（在闭壳层情况下等于 ``EF12_RHFRELAX``\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"``EF12_RHFRELAX`` CABS singles correction of the reference energy (only the "
"spin-free contribution is used)."
msgstr "``EF12_RHFRELAX`` 参考能的 CABS 单激发修正（仅使用自旋无关的贡献）。"

msgid "``ANSATZ`` The requested ansatz (string variable)"
msgstr "``ANSATZ`` 所请求的拟设（字符串变量）"

msgid ""
"Variables corresponding to ``EF12_`` exist also for ``EF12S_`` and "
"``EF12D_``."
msgstr "对应于 ``EF12_`` 的变量也存在于 ``EF12S_`` 和 ``EF12D_`` 中。"

msgid "In case of doubt or problems, try in a test calculation"
msgstr "如有疑问或问题，请在测试计算中尝试"

msgid "``SHOW,ENERG*,EMP2*,EF12*``"
msgstr "``SHOW,ENERG*,EMP2*,EF12*``"

msgid ""
"This should show all relevant variables that exist. Note that system "
"variables are internally stored with an underscore as a prefix, and this may"
" be shown by the SHOW command. The variables can be accessed with or without"
" underscore (but if the user defines a variable with the same name then the "
"underscore is needed to access the system variable and not the user "
"variable)."
msgstr ""
"这将显示所有存在的相关变量。请注意，系统变量在内部存储时带有下划线作为前缀，这可能会由 SHOW "
"命令显示。变量可以带或不带下划线进行访问（但如果用户定义了同名的变量，则需要下划线来访问系统变量而非用户变量）。"

msgid "Analytical gradients for MP2-F12 and CCSD(T)-F12"
msgstr "MP2-F12 和 CCSD(T)-F12 的解析梯度"

msgid ""
"Analytical energy gradients are available for DF-MP2-F12, DF-CCSD-F12, and "
"DF-CCSD(T)-F12 methods using the density fitting approximation. The ``AIC`` "
"density fitting integral program computes the two- and three-index integrals"
" and integral derivatives required. Analytical gradients are available only "
"for a subset of approximations listed above. For the rest of F12 "
"approximations, equilibrium geometries and other properties can be computed "
"by using numerical differentiation of the energies. In the following, we "
"describe only those options which must be used for analytical gradients."
msgstr ""
"使用密度拟合近似，DF-MP2-F12、DF-CCSD-F12 和 DF-CCSD(T)-F12 方法可提供解析能量梯度。\\ ``AIC`` "
"密度拟合积分程序计算所需的两指标和三指标积分及其导数。解析梯度仅适用于上述列出的部分近似方法。对于其余的 F12 "
"近似方法，可以通过对能量进行数值微分来计算平衡几何结构和其他性质。以下，我们仅描述必须用于解析梯度的那些选项。"

msgid ""
"Explicitly correlated property calculations can be performed using the "
"commands followed by ``FORCE`` or ``OPTG`` of the form, for example for "
"geometry optimizations,"
msgstr "显式相关性质计算可以使用后跟 ``FORCE`` 或 ``OPTG`` 的命令来执行，例如对于几何优化，其形式为"

msgid ""
"``DF-MP2-F12`` Closed-shell canonical MP2-F12 using the density fitting "
"approximation for all integrals and their derivatives as described in `J. "
"Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.5003065>`__ **147**, 214101 "
"(2017), doi: 10.1063/1.5003065. Only the fixed amplitude approximation "
"without forming CABS orbitals is considered."
msgstr ""
"``DF-MP2-F12`` 使用密度拟合近似处理所有积分及其导数的闭壳层正则 MP2-F12，如 `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.5003065>`__ **147**, 214101 (2017), doi: "
"10.1063/1.5003065 所述。仅考虑不形成 CABS 轨道的固定振幅近似。"

msgid ""
"``DF-CCSD-F12`` Closed-shell CCSD-F12 approximations using the density "
"fitting approximation for all integrals and their derivatives as described "
"in `J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.5020436>`__ **148**, 114104"
" (2018), doi: 10.1063/1.5020436. Only the fixed amplitude ansatz is used "
"without constructing CABS orbitals. Both CCSD-F12a and F12b explicitly "
"correlated coupled cluster approximations are available. By default, the "
"CCSD-F12b approximation is used. Some parts the implementation are brute-"
"force, therefore large memory and disk space may be required."
msgstr ""
"``DF-CCSD-F12`` 使用密度拟合近似处理所有积分及其导数的闭壳层 CCSD-F12 近似，如 `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.5020436>`__ **148**, 114104 (2018), doi: "
"10.1063/1.5020436 所述。仅使用不构建 CABS 轨道的固定振幅拟设。CCSD-F12a 和 F12b "
"两种显式相关耦合簇近似均可用。默认使用 CCSD-F12b 近似。实现的某些部分是蛮力计算，因此可能需要较大的内存和磁盘空间。"

msgid ""
"``DF-CCSD(T)-F12`` Same as DF-CCSD-F12, but perturbative triples are added. "
"The scaled version of (T) is currently not available. See details in `J. "
"Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.5020436>`__ **148**, 114104 "
"(2018)."
msgstr ""
"``DF-CCSD(T)-F12`` 与 DF-CCSD-F12 相同，但添加了微扰三重激发。目前尚无可用的缩放版本 (T)。详见 `J. Chem. "
"Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.5020436>`__ **148**, 114104 (2018)。"

msgid ""
"**Note: analytical gradients are only computed if certain Ansätze and "
"options are used, see below. If these are not given, numerical gradients are"
" used.**"
msgstr "**注意：仅当使用特定的拟设和选项时才会计算解析梯度，见下文。如果未给出这些，则使用数值梯度。**"

msgid ""
"The analytical gradients for F12 methods are implemented using the "
"integrated tensor framework (ITF) of G. Knizia. This program uses slightly "
"different RI approximations than the standard F12 programs. In particular, "
"the CABS approach is not used and the CABS singles correction is not "
"available. Due to the different RI treatment, the energies are only "
"identical to the standard ones if the OPTRI basis sets are used. In this "
"case the RI basis is the union of the orbital basis and the OPTRI basis, and"
" exactly the same results as with the CABS approach are obtained. It is "
"therefore recommended to use the OPTRI basis when available."
msgstr ""
"F12 方法的解析梯度是使用 G. Knizia 的集成张量框架 (ITF) 实现的。该程序使用的 RI 近似与标准 F12 "
"程序略有不同。特别是，不使用 CABS 方法，且 CABS 单激发修正不可用。由于 RI 处理方式不同，仅当使用 OPTRI "
"基组时，能量才与标准结果相同。在这种情况下，RI 基组是轨道基组与 OPTRI 基组的并集，并且得到的结果与使用 CABS "
"方法的结果完全相同。因此，建议在可用时使用 OPTRI 基组。"

