msgstr "或"

msgid ""
"Note that, property calculations including CABS singles corrections must be "
"done by combining numerical derivatives for HF+CABS singles method and F12 "
"analytical gradients. For geometry optimizations see details in `adding CABS"
" singles correction in CCSD(T)-F12 geometry optimization "
"<geometry_optimization_optg.html#adding-cabs-singles-correction-in-ccsd-"
"t-f12-geometry-optimization>`__."
msgstr ""
"请注意，包含 CABS 单激发修正的性质计算必须通过结合 HF+CABS 单激发方法的数值导数和 F12 解析梯度来完成。关于几何优化的详细信息，请参阅"
" `在 CCSD(T)-F12 几何优化中添加 CABS 单激发修正 <optg.html#ccsd-t-f12-cabs>`__\\ 。"

msgid "Expectation values for MP2-F12 and CCSD(T)-F12"
msgstr "MP2-F12 和 CCSD(T)-F12 的期望值"

msgid ""
"One-electron properties can be computed if an ``EXPEC`` directive follows "
"the ``DF-MP2-F12``, ``DF-CCSD``, or ``DF-CCSD(T)`` cards (the ``GEXPEC`` "
"directive has no effect in this case). Properties are obtained as analytical"
" energy derivatives with or without taking into account the orbital "
"relaxation, which can be specified as"
msgstr ""
"如果在 ``DF-MP2-F12``\\ 、\\ ``DF-CCSD`` 或 ``DF-CCSD(T)`` 卡片后跟随一个 ``EXPEC`` "
"指令（此时 ``GEXPEC`` 指令无效），则可以计算单电子性质。这些性质作为解析能量导数获得，可以选择是否考虑轨道弛豫，具体可通过以下方式指定："

msgid ""
"Note also that calculations including CABS singles corrections must be done "
"by adding the CABS singles contribution computed separately. The syntax for "
"operators *opname* is explained in section `One-electron operators and "
"expectation values (GEXPEC) <program_control.html#one-electron-operators-"
"and-expectation-values-gexpec>`__. See also ``DM`` in section `saving the "
"density matrix <moller_plesset_perturbation_theory.html#saving-the-density-"
"matrix>`__, and ``NATORB`` in section `natural orbitals "
"<moller_plesset_perturbation_theory.html#natural-orbitals>`__."
msgstr ""
"还需注意，包含 CABS 单激发修正的计算必须通过单独计算并添加 CABS 单激发贡献来完成。算符 *opname* 的语法在章节 `单电子算符与期望值"
" (GEXPEC) <program_control.html#one-electron-operators-and-expectation-"
"values-gexpec>`__ 中解释。另请参见章节 `保存密度矩阵 "
"<moller_plesset_perturbation_theory.html#saving-the-density-matrix>`__ 中的 "
"``DM``\\ ，以及章节 `自然轨道 <moller_plesset_perturbation_theory.html#natural-"
"orbitals>`__ 中的 ``NATORB``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"**DF-LMP2-F12** Closed-shell DF-MP2-F12 with localized orbitals. Any method "
