"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1080/00268976.2017.1417646>`__ **116**, 1435 "
"(2018)（SCS-DCSD-F12）。 W. Győrffy, G. Knizia, and H.-J. Werner, `J. Chem. "
"Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.5003065>`__ **147**, 214101 (2017); W. "
"Győrffy and H.-J. Werner, J. Chem. Phys. **148**, 114104 (2018); "
"https://doi.org/10.1063/1.5020436（所有使用 F12 梯度的梯度和性质计算）。"

msgid ""
"In the following, we briefly summarize the ansätze and approximations that "
"can be used in single-reference treatments. For more details and further "
"references to related work of other authors see H.-J. Werner, T. B. Adler, "
"and F. R. Manby, *General orbital invariant MP2-F12 theory*, `J. Chem. Phys."
" <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.2712434>`__ **126**, 164102 (2007) (in the "
"following denoted **I**). More information about MRCI-F12 calculations are "
"given in section `explicitly correlated MRCI-F12 "
"<the_mrci_program.html#explicitly-correlated-mrci-f12>`__"
msgstr ""
"下面，我们简要总结可用于单参考处理的拟设和近似。更多细节以及其他作者相关工作的进一步参考文献参见 H.-J. Werner, T. B. Adler, "
"and F. R. Manby, *General orbital invariant MP2-F12 theory*, `J. Chem. Phys."
" <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.2712434>`__ **126**, 164102 (2007)（下文记为 "
"**I**\\ ）。关于 MRCI-F12 计算的更多信息见 `显式相关 MRCI-F12 "
"<the_mrci_program.html#explicitly-correlated-mrci-f12>`__ 节"

msgid ""
"For explicitly correlated local methods for large molecules see :doc:`Local "
"correlation methods with pair natural orbitals (PNOs). "
"<local_correlation_methods_with_pair_natural_orbitals_pnos>`"
msgstr ""
"关于大分子的显式相关局域方法，请参见 :doc:`使用对自然轨道（PNO）的局域相关方法。 "
"<local_correlation_methods_with_pair_natural_orbitals_pnos>`"

msgid ""
"The conventional external pair functions are augmented by terms of the form "
"\\begin{align}"
msgstr "常规外部对函数由如下形式的项增广 \\begin{align}"

msgid ""
"This ansatz is orbital invariant (i.e., the same results are obtained with "
"canonical or localized orbitals), but it often suffers from geminal basis "
"set superposition errors. Furthermore, singularities may occur in the "
"zeroth-order Hamiltonian, in particular for larger systems. Therefore, this "
"ansatz is normally not recommended."
msgstr ""
"该拟设是轨道不变的（即，使用正则轨道或定域轨道得到相同结果），但常常受到双电子基组叠加误差的影响。此外，零阶哈密顿量中可能出现奇点，尤其是对于较大体系。因此，通常不推荐该拟设。"

msgid ""
"The sum over :math:`kl` in equation \\eqref{eq:uij} is restricted to "
":math:`ij`. This ansatz is not orbital invariant and size consistent only "
"when localized orbitals are used. However, geminal basis set superposition "
"errors are absent and therefore the results are often more accurate than "
"with the general ansatz."
msgstr ""
"方程 \\eqref{eq:uij} 中对 :math:`kl` 的求和限制为 :math:`ij`\\ "
"。该拟设不是轨道不变的，并且仅当使用定域轨道时才具有大小一致性。然而，双电子基组叠加误差不存在，因此结果通常比一般拟设更精确。"

msgid ""
"Various approximations such as A, B, C, HY1, HY2 exist for the matrix "
"elements of the first-order Hamiltonian (see **I**). They differ in the way "
"the RI approximations are made. In the limit of a complete RI basis, "
"approximations B and C are identical and yield the exact result for a given "
"wave function ansatz. We generally recommend approximation C, which is "
"simpler and more efficient than approximation B. Normally, the union of the "
"AO and RI basis sets is used to approximate the resolution of the identity "
"(CABS approach). In the hybrid approximations (HY1, HY2, HX) only the AO "
"basis is used in some less important terms. Together with the recommended "
"approximation C, HY1 or HY2 can be used; HY2 is more accurate, HY1 more "
"efficient. In most cases, approximation 3C(HY1) provides an excellent "
"compromise between accuracy and efficiency. In approximation A, all terms "
"involving exchange operators are neglected. This approximation is used along"
" with local approximations in our low-order scaling LMP2-F12/3\\*A(loc) "
"method that can be applied to large molecules (cf. section `DF-LMP2-F12 and "
"DF-LCCSD(T)-F12 calculations with local approximations "
"<explicitly_correlated_methods.html#df-lmp2-f12-and-df-lccsd-"
"t-f12-calculations-with-local-approximations>`__)"
msgstr ""
"对于一阶哈密顿量的矩阵元，存在诸如 A、B、C、HY1、HY2 等各种近似（见 **I**\\ ）。它们的不同在于进行 RI 近似的方式。在完备 RI "
"基组的极限下，近似 B 和 C 相同，并给出给定波函数拟设的精确结果。我们通常推荐近似 C，它比近似 B 更简单、更高效。通常，使用 AO 和 RI "
"基组的并集来近似分辨率恒等（CABS 方法）。在混合近似（HY1、HY2、HX）中，一些较不重要的项仅使用 AO 基组。与推荐的近似 C 一起，可使用 "
"HY1 或 HY2；HY2 更精确，HY1 更高效。在大多数情况下，近似 3C(HY1) 在精度和效率之间提供了极好的折中。在近似 A "
"中，所有涉及交换算符的项被忽略。该近似与局域近似一起用于我们的低阶标度 LMP2-F12/3\\*A(loc) 方法中，该方法可应用于大分子（参见 "
"`带局域近似的 DF-LMP2-F12 和 DF-LCCSD(T)-F12 计算 "
"<explicitly_correlated_methods.html#df-lmp2-f12-and-df-lccsd-"
"t-f12-calculations-with-local-approximations>`__ 节）"

msgid ""
"Other basis sets can be chosen using the ``DF_BASIS``, ``DF_BASIS_EXCH`` and"
" ``RI_BASIS`` options (cf. section `options "
"<explicitly_correlated_methods.html#options>`__). See section :doc:`density "
"fitting <density_fitting>` for more details about density fitting."
msgstr ""
"可使用 ``DF_BASIS``\\ 、\\ ``DF_BASIS_EXCH`` 和 ``RI_BASIS`` 选项选择其他基组（参见 `选项 "
"<explicitly_correlated_methods.html#options>`__ 节）。关于密度拟合的更多细节见 :doc:`密度拟合 "
"<density_fitting>` 节。"

msgid "examples/h2o_basissets1.inp"
msgstr "examples/h2o_basissets1.inp"

msgid "examples/h2o_basissets2.inp"
msgstr "examples/h2o_basissets2.inp"

msgid "examples/h2o_basissets3.inp"
msgstr "examples/h2o_basissets3.inp"

msgid ""
"``DF_BASIS=basis`` Select the basis for density fitting (see section "
":doc:`density fitting <density_fitting>` for details). *basis* can either "
"refer to a set name defined in the basis block, or to a default MP2 fitting "
"basis (e.g., ``DF_BASIS=VTZ`` generates the ``VTZ/MP2FIT`` basis). By "
"default, the MP2FIT basis that corresponds to the orbital basis is used."
msgstr ""
"``DF_BASIS=basis`` 选择用于密度拟合的基组（详见 :doc:`密度拟合 <density_fitting>` 节）。\\ "
"*basis* 可以指基组块中定义的集合名称，或默认的 MP2 拟合基组（例如，\\ ``DF_BASIS=VTZ`` 生成 "
"``VTZ/MP2FIT`` 基组）。默认情况下，使用与轨道基组相对应的 MP2FIT 基组。"

msgid ""
"``RI_BASIS=basis`` Select the basis for the resolution of the identity (RI)."
" This can refer to a default basis set or a set name defined in a basis "
"block. For F12 methods the Hartree-Fock JKFIT basis sets perform well for "
"the RI, despite having been optimized for other purposes. These sets are "
"used by default for the AVnZ orbital basis sets. The basis type can be "
"appended to the basis name after a slash, e.g."
msgstr ""
"``RI_BASIS=basis`` 选择用于分辨率恒等（RI）的基组。这可以指默认基组或基组块中定义的集合名称。对于 F12 方法，Hartree-"
"Fock JKFIT 基组在 RI 中表现良好，尽管它们是为其他目的优化的。这些基组默认用于 AVnZ "
"轨道基组。基组类型可以在斜杠后附加到基组名称，例如"

msgid ""
"``RI_BASIS=AVQZ/JKFIT`` would use the specified JKFIT set, or "
"``RI_BASIS=AVQZ/OPTRI`` would use the optimized CABS basis sets of Peterson "
"et al. These are recommended for the AVnZ and VnZ-F12 basis sets and used by"
" default for the latter ones. Note that each OPTRI basis is associated to a "
"specific orbital basis. Therefore, the name of the OPTRI basis must either "
"be the same as that of the orbital basis, or be omitted, e.g., "
"``RI_BASIS=OPTRI`` selects automatically the correct set for the current "
"orbital basis. In case of R12-methods (which are not recommended to be "
"used), the RI basis should be chosen to be a large uncontracted AO basis (at"
" least AVQZ). Contraction/uncontraction can be forced appending "
"``(CONTRACT)`` or ``(UNCONTRACT)`` to the basis name, e.g., "
"``RI_BASIS=AVQZ(UNCONTRACT)/ORBITAL``. If other options are given in "
"parenthesis, these can be separated by commas, e.g., "
"``RI_BASIS=AVQZ(f/d,UNCONTRACT)/ORBITAL.\\\\`` Alternative forms, which "
"should work as well, are ``RI_BASIS=AVQZ(f/d)(UNCONTRACT)/ORBITAL\\\\`` or "
"``RI_BASIS=AVQZ(f/d)/ORBITAL(UNCONTRACT).\\\\`` Note that the "
"CONTRACT/UNCONTRACT option cannot be used with basis set names previously "
"defined in a basis block."
msgstr ""
"``RI_BASIS=AVQZ/JKFIT`` 将使用指定的 JKFIT 基组，或 ``RI_BASIS=AVQZ/OPTRI`` 将使用 "
"Peterson 等人的优化 CABS 基组。这些基组推荐用于 AVnZ 和 VnZ-F12 基组，并且对于后者默认使用。注意，每个 OPTRI "
"基组都与特定的轨道基组相关联。因此，OPTRI 基组的名称必须与轨道基组的名称相同，或者省略，例如，\\ ``RI_BASIS=OPTRI`` "
"会自动为当前轨道基组选择正确的集合。对于 R12 方法（不推荐使用），RI 基组应选择为大的未收缩 AO 基组（至少 "
"AVQZ）。可以通过在基组名称后附加 ``(CONTRACT)`` 或 ``(UNCONTRACT)`` 来强制收缩/未收缩，例如，\\ "
"``RI_BASIS=AVQZ(UNCONTRACT)/ORBITAL``\\ 。如果括号中给出了其他选项，可以用逗号分隔，例如，\\ "
"``RI_BASIS=AVQZ(f/d,UNCONTRACT)/ORBITAL.\\\\`` 同样可用的替代形式是 "
"``RI_BASIS=AVQZ(f/d)(UNCONTRACT)/ORBITAL\\\\`` 或 "
"``RI_BASIS=AVQZ(f/d)/ORBITAL(UNCONTRACT).\\\\`` 注意，CONTRACT/UNCONTRACT "
"选项不能与先前在基组块中定义的基组名称一起使用。"

msgid "**``PRINT``\\ =\\ *ipri*** Select output level:"
msgstr "**``PRINT``\\ =\\ *\\ ipri*** 选择输出级别："

msgid ""
"**``THRABS=``\\ *thrabs*** Threshold for smallest eigenvalue of S in "
"auxiliary ABS (only used with ``ORTHO_CABS=1``; default=\\ ``THRCABS``)."
msgstr ""
"**``THRABS=``\\ *\\ thrabs*** 辅助 ABS 中 S 最小本征值的阈值（仅与 ``ORTHO_CABS=1`` "
"一起使用；默认=\\ ``THRCABS``\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"**``THRCABS=``\\ *thrcabs*** Threshold for smallest eigenvalue of S in CABS "
"(default 1.d-8)."
msgstr "**``THRCABS=``\\ *\\ thrcabs*** CABS 中 S 最小本征值的阈值（默认 1.d-8）。"

msgid ""
"**``THRCABS_REL=``\\ *thrcabs_rel*** Relative CABS threshold (default "
"1.d-9). The actual threshold is ``max(thrcabs,eigmax*thrcabs_rel``, where "
"``eigmax`` is the largest eigenvalue of the overlap matrix."
msgstr ""
"**``THRCABS_REL=``\\ *\\ thrcabs_rel*** 相对 CABS 阈值（默认 1.d-9）。实际阈值为 "
"``max(thrcabs,eigmax*\\ thrcabs_rel\\ ``，其中 ``\\ eigmax`` 是重叠矩阵的最大本征值。"

msgid ""
"**``PRINT=``\\ *level*** Print parameter. ``PRINT=1`` give information about"
" all computed integrals and the iterations."
msgstr "**``PRINT=``\\ *\\ level*** 打印参数。\\ ``PRINT=1`` 给出有关所有计算积分和迭代的信息。"

msgid "**``DEBUG=``\\ *level*** Can be used to obtain extended debug print."
msgstr "**``DEBUG=``\\ *\\ level*** 可用于获得扩展调试打印。"

msgid ""
"implies a canonical 3C calculation with diagonal ansatz 3C, using fixed "
"coefficient and hybrid approximations. The combination of the options "
"``fix=1`` and ``canonical=1`` implies a non-iterative calculation of the "
"energy and is recommended. The above is equivalent to all of the following:"
msgstr ""
"意味着使用固定系数和混合近似的对角拟设 3C 的正则 3C 计算。选项 ``fix=1`` 和 ``canonical=1`` "
"的组合意味着非迭代能量计算，并且是推荐的。上述等价于以下所有形式："

msgid ""
"``ANSATZ=3C(FIXC,HY1)\\\\`` ``ANSATZ=3C(D,FIXC,HY1)\\\\`` "
"``ANSATZ=3C(D,HY1,FIX),canonical=1``"
msgstr ""
"``ANSATZ=3C(FIXC,HY1)\\\\`` ``ANSATZ=3C(D,FIXC,HY1)\\\\`` "
"``ANSATZ=3C(D,HY1,FIX),canonical=1``"

msgid ""
"By default, the perturbative CABS singles correction as described in `J. "
"Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.2817618>`__ **127**, 221106 (2007)"
" and `J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.2889388>`__ **128**, "
"154103 (2008) is included in the reference energy of all MP2-F12, CCSD-F12, "
"and CCSD(T)-F12 calculations (closed and open-shell). Since Molpro 2025.3 "
"this is also the case in the PNO-F12 programs. An exception is "
"LMP2-F12/3\\*A(loc), which is done with a different program. In this cases "
"the F12 correction can be computed beforehand and is then added "
"automatically (see section :doc:`Local correlation methods with pair natural"
" orbitals (PNOs). "
"<local_correlation_methods_with_pair_natural_orbitals_pnos>`) The corrected "
"reference energy is stored in variable ``ENERGR``, so that ``ENERGY-ENERGR``"
" are the total correlation energies. For the setting of other variables by "
"the F12 programs see section `variables set by the F12 programs "
"<explicitly_correlated_methods.html#variables-set-by-the-f12-programs>`__."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，所有 MP2-F12、CCSD-F12 和 CCSD(T)-F12 计算（闭壳层和开壳层）的参考能量中包含 `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.2817618>`__ **127**, 221106 (2007) 和 `J. Chem."
" Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.2889388>`__ **128**, 154103 (2008) "
"中所述的微扰 CABS 单激发修正。自 Molpro 2025.3 起，PNO-F12 程序中也是如此。例外是 "
"LMP2-F12/3\\*A(loc)，它由不同的程序执行。在这种情况下，F12 修正可以预先计算然后自动添加（参见 "
":doc:`使用对自然轨道（PNO）的局域相关方法。 "
"<local_correlation_methods_with_pair_natural_orbitals_pnos>`\\ "
"）修正后的参考能量存储在变量 ``ENERGR`` 中，因此 ``ENERGY-ENERGR`` 是总相关能。关于 F12 "
"程序设置其他变量的信息，请参见 `由 F12 程序设置的变量 "
"<explicitly_correlated_methods.html#variables-set-by-the-f12-programs>`__ 节。"

msgid "examples/br2_f12_multgem.inp"
msgstr "examples/br2_f12_multgem.inp"

msgid ""
"Local variants of the DF-MP2-F12 and CCSD(T)-F12 methods are invoked by the "
"commands ``DF-LMP2-F12``, ``DF-LCCSD-F12``, ``DF-LCCSD(T)-F12`` with ansatz "
"3\\*A(LOC) [for DF-LCCSD-F12 fixed amplitudes are used, i.e., the default is"
" 3\\*A(LOC,FIX)]. **Note: The methods and options described in this section "
"refer the older PAO-based local methods. Explicitly correlated variants of "
"the more recent and more accurate PNO methods are also available and "
"described in section :doc:`local correlation methods with pair natural "
"orbitals (PNOs) "
"<local_correlation_methods_with_pair_natural_orbitals_pnos>`.**"
msgstr ""
"DF-MP2-F12 和 CCSD(T)-F12 方法的局域变体通过命令 ``DF-LMP2-F12``\\ 、\\ ``DF-"
"LCCSD-F12``\\ 、\\ ``DF-LCCSD(T)-F12`` 以拟设 3\\*A(LOC) 调用 [对于 DF-"
"LCCSD-F12，使用固定振幅，即默认为 3\\*\\ A(LOC,FIX)]。\\ **注意：本节描述的方法和选项涉及较旧的基于 PAO "
"的局域方法。更新且更精确的 PNO 方法的显式相关变体也可用，并在 :doc:`使用对自然轨道（PNO）的局域相关方法 "
"<local_correlation_methods_with_pair_natural_orbitals_pnos>` 节中描述。**"

msgid ""
"The DF-LMP2-F12 calculations are performed with a different program than "
"non-local calculations. The (LOC) option implies that the LMP2 calculation "
"with domain approximations is performed, and by default a local projector as"
" first described in H.-J. Werner, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.2982419>`__ **129**, 101103 (2008) is used "
"[see also T. B. Adler, F. R. Manby, and H.-J. Werner, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3040174>`__ **130**, 054106 (2009); T. B. "
"Adler and H.-J. Werner, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3160675>`__ **130**, 241101 (2009); T. B. "
"Adler and H.-H. Werner, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3647565>`__ **135**, 144117 (2011)] This "
"yields very similar results as the corresponding canonical methods at much "
"lower cost ((ANSATZ=3\\*A(LOC,FIX) is exactly equivalent to "
"ANSATZ=3\\*A(FIX,NOX),PROJF=2,CABS=0,CABS_SINGLES=0, but if the latter "
"options are used the non-local program is used to compute the F12 correction"
" and local approximations are only simulated. CABS singles can then be "
"included by omitting the CABS_SINGLES=0 option. )) and the method can be "
"applied to quite large molecules."
msgstr ""
"DF-LMP2-F12 计算由与非局域计算不同的程序执行。(LOC) 选项意味着执行带域近似的 LMP2 计算，并且默认使用最早由 H.-J. "
"Werner 描述的局域投影算符，\\ `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.2982419>`__ **129**, 101103 (2008) [另见 T. B. "
"Adler, F. R. Manby, and H.-J. Werner, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3040174>`__ **130**, 054106 (2009); T. B. "
"Adler and H.-J. Werner, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3160675>`__ **130**, 241101 (2009); T. B. "
"Adler and H.-H. Werner, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3647565>`__ **135**, 144117 (2011)] "
"这在低得多的成本下产生与相应正则方法非常相似的结果（(ANSATZ=3\\*A(LOC,FIX) 完全等价于 ANSATZ=3\\*\\ "
"A(FIX,NOX),PROJF=2,CABS=0,CABS_SINGLES=0，但如果使用后者的选项，则使用非局域程序计算 F12 "
"修正，局域近似只是被模拟。此时可以通过省略 CABS_SINGLES=0 选项来包含 CABS 单激发。）并且该方法可应用于相当大的分子。"

msgid ""
"Special options for these local variants are (local RI works only with "
"ansatz 3\\*A):"
msgstr "这些局域变体的特殊选项是（局域 RI 仅适用于拟设 3\\*A）："

msgid "``PAIRS`` Specifies which pairs to be treated by R12 or F12"
msgstr "``PAIRS`` 指定哪些对由 R12 或 F12 处理"

msgid ""
"(``STRONG|CLOSE|WEAK|ALL``; pairs up to the given level are included). The "
"default is ``ALL``. Note that even with ``ALL`` very distant pairs are "
"neglected if these are neglected in the LMP2 as well."
msgstr ""
"（\\ ``STRONG|CLOSE|WEAK|ALL``\\ ；包含到给定层级为止的对）。默认值为 ``ALL``\\ 。请注意，即使使用 "
"``ALL``\\ ，如果在 LMP2 中也忽略了极远对，则这些极远对同样会被忽略。"

msgid ""
"``FITDOM`` Determine how the base fitting domains are determined (only "
"applies if ``LOCFIT_F12=1``):"
msgstr "``FITDOM`` 确定基础拟合域的确定方式（仅当 ``LOCFIT_F12=1`` 时适用）："

msgid ""
"0: Fitdomains based on united operator domains; 1: Fitdomains based in "
"orbital domains (default); 2: Fitdomains based on united pair domains using "
"strong pairs; 3: Fitdomains based on united pair domains using strong, close"
" and weak pairs. Note: This is the only option implemented in the DF-LMP2 "
"program. Therefore, the DF-LMP2 and DF-LMP2-F12 programs might give slightly"
" different results if default values are used."
msgstr ""
"0：拟合域基于联合算符域；1：拟合域基于轨道域（默认）；2：拟合域基于使用强对的联合对域；3：拟合域基于使用强对、近对和弱对的联合对域。注意：这是 "
"DF-LMP2 程序中唯一实现的选项。因此，如果使用默认值，DF-LMP2 和 DF-LMP2-F12 程序可能会给出略有不同的结果。"

msgid ""
"Further options for density fitting are described in section :doc:`density "
"fitting <density_fitting>`, and further options to choose the ansatz in "
"section `choosing the ansatz and the level of approximation "
"<explicitly_correlated_methods.html#choosing-the-ansatz-and-the-level-of-"
"approximation>`__."
msgstr ""
"密度拟合的更多选项在 :doc:`density fitting <density_fitting>` 一节中描述，选择拟设的更多选项在 "
"`choosing the ansatz and the level of approximation "
"<explicitly_correlated_methods.html#choosing-the-ansatz-and-the-level-of-"
"approximation>`__ 一节中描述。"

msgid "*command*, *options*; ``OPTG``"
msgstr "*command*\\ ，\\ *options*\\ ；\\ ``OPTG``"

msgid ""
"**[\\tt{ansatz=3C(FIX,HY1)}]** Ansatz 3C with hybrid approximation, see `J. "
"Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.2712434>`__ **126**, 164102 "
"(2007);"
msgstr ""
"**[\\tt{ansatz=3C(FIX,HY1)}]** 采用混合近似的拟设 3C，参见 `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.2712434>`__ **126**\\ ，164102 (2007)；"

msgid ""
"corresponds to DF-CCSD(T)-F12b/3\\*C(FIX,HY1) without CABS treatment and "
"without CABS singles correction. Fixed amplitudes, ``FIX``, are always used "
"in CCSD(T)-F12. By default, the explicitly correlated coupled cluster "
"approximation F12b is used. Optionally, F12a or F12b can be appended to the "
"command in order to choose the corresponding approximation, such as"
msgstr ""
"对应于不带 CABS 处理且不带 CABS 单激发修正的 DF-CCSD(T)-F12b/3\\*C(FIX,HY1)。在 CCSD(T)-F12 "
"中始终使用固定振幅 ``FIX``\\ 。默认使用显式相关耦合簇近似 F12b。可选地，可以在命令后附加 F12a 或 F12b 以选择相应的近似，例如"

msgid "``EXPEC[,[TYPE=]type][,opname]``"
msgstr "``EXPEC[,[TYPE=]type][,opname]``"

msgid ""
"**``TYPE``:** *type*\\ =\\ ``RELAX``: Compute fully relaxed properties with "
"taking into account the orbital relaxation (default). Nonrelaxed properties "
"are also computed and printed. For MP2, this option is highly recommended."
msgstr ""
"**``TYPE``：** *type*\\ =\\ ``RELAX``\\ "
"：计算考虑轨道弛豫的完全弛豫性质（默认）。同时也会计算并打印非弛豫性质。对于 MP2，强烈推荐使用此选项。"

msgid ""
"*type*\\ =\\ ``NORELAX``: Compute properties without taking into account the"
" orbital relaxation."
msgstr "*type*\\ =\\ ``NORELAX``\\ ：计算不考虑轨道弛豫的性质。"

msgid ""
"***opname*:** Currently only dipole moment can be computed, *opname*\\ =\\ "
"``DM``."
msgstr "***opname*\\ ：** 目前只能计算偶极矩，*\\ opname*\\ =\\ ``DM``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"The same restrictions for the ansatz as described for gradients in section "
"`analytical gradients for MP2-F12 and CCSD(T)-F12 "
"<explicitly_correlated_methods.html#analytical-gradients-for-mp2-f12-and-"
"ccsd-t-f12>`__ apply. For ``DF-MP2-F12`` the ansatz must be specified, since"
" without ``EXPEC`` a different ``DF-MP2-F12`` program is used, and ansatz 3C"
" is the default. Slightly different RI approximations are used with the "
"gradient ``DF-MP2-F12`` code, and this leads to slightly different energies "
"even with the same ansatz specified."
msgstr ""
"对拟设的限制与 `analytical gradients for MP2-F12 and CCSD(T)-F12 "
"<explicitly_correlated_methods.html#analytical-gradients-for-mp2-f12-and-"
"ccsd-t-f12>`__ 一节中梯度所述相同。对于 ``DF-MP2-F12`` 必须指定拟设，因为不使用 ``EXPEC`` 时会使用另一个 "
"``DF-MP2-F12`` 程序，而拟设 3C 是默认值。梯度 ``DF-MP2-F12`` 代码使用略有不同的 RI "
"近似，因此即使指定相同的拟设，也会导致能量略有不同。"
